hadiths[125]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1629","[AI-translation] ´Abu Sa'eed Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : mein ne sonay ki haalat mein dekha ke log mere saamnay laaye jatay hain aur wo kartay pehnay hue hain baaz ke kartay chhaati tak hain aur baaz ke us ke neechay phir Umar raziyallahu anhu niklay to wo itna neecha kurta pehnay hue thay jo ke zameen par ghisatta jata tha logon ne arz kiya : Ae Allah ke Rasool ! us ki taabeer kiya hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke deen "
"1630","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : mein sau raha tha aur sotay mein aik pyala mere saamnay laya gaya jis mein doodh tha mein ne us mein se piya yahan tak ke taazgi aur sairaabi mere naakhunon se nikalnay lagi phir jo bacha wo mein ne Umar bin Khattab ko de diya logon ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! us ki taabeer kiya hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke us ki taabeer ilm hai "
"1631","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke mein sauya hua tha mein ne apne Aap ko aik kunwein par dekha ke us par dole para hua hai pas mein ne us dole se pani khaincha jitna ke Allah ne chaha phir us ko Abu Quhafa ke betay yani Siddiq Akbar ne liya aur aik ya do dole nikalay aur un ke kheenchnay mein kamzori thi Allah Taala un ko bakhshay phir wo dole pul yani bara dole ho gaya aur us ko Umar bin Khattab ne liya to mein ne logon mein aisa sardar shah zor nahi dekha jo Umar ki tarah pani kheenchta ho unhon ne us kasrat se pani nikala ke log apne apne oonton ko sairaab kar ke aaraam ki jagah le gaye (ulama ne bayan kiya hai ke us khwab mein Aap ke baad Abu Bakr o Umar raziyallahu anhuma ki khilafat ki tamseel o bishaarat aur haalaat ki paishan goyi hai) "
"1632","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : mein sau raha tha aur mein ne apne Aap ko jannat mein dekha wahan aik aurat aik mehal ke konay mein wuzu kar rahi thi mein ne poocha ke ye mehal kis ka hai (farishtay) bolay ke Umar bin Khattab ka ye sun kar mujhe us ki ghairat ka khayal aaya aur mein peeth mor kar laut aaya Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke Umar raziyallahu anhu ne jab ye suna to ro diye aur ham sab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath majlis mein thay phir Umar raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke mere maan baap Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par qurban hun Ae Allah ke Rasool ! kiya mein Aap par ghairat karun ga "
"1633","[AI-translation] ´Fateh-e-Iran Sa'd bin Abu Waqqas (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Umar raziyallahu anhu ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se andar aanay ki ijazat maangi aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas us waqt Quraish ki aurtein baithi thin aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se baatein kar rahi thin aur bohat baatein kar rahi thin aur un ki aawazein buland thin jab Umar raziyallahu anhu ne aawaz di to uth kar chhupnay ke liye daurein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Umar raziyallahu anhu ko ijazat di aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam muskura rahay thay Umar raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke Allah Taala Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko hansta rakhay Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mujhe un auraton par taajjub hua jo mere paas baithi thin tumhari aawaz suntay hi parday mein bhaag gayein Umar raziyallahu anhu ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! un ko Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se zyada darrna chahiye phir un auraton se kaha ke Ae apni jaan ki dushmano ! tum mujh se darrti ho aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se nahi dartein unhon ne kaha ke haan tum Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke ba nisbat sakht ho aur ghuseelay ho Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke qasam us ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai ke shaitaan jab tumhein kisi raah mein chalta hua milta hai to us raah ko jis mein tum chaltay ho chhor kar doosri raah mein chala jata hai "
"1634","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat karti hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : tum se pehle agli ummaton mein aisay log hua kartay thay jo ” muhaddas “ (jin ki raye theek hoti gumaan sahih hota ya farishtay un ko ilhaam kartay) meri ummat mein agar aisa koi ho to Umar bin al-Khattaab hun ge bin Wahb ne kaha ke muhaddasoon ka maani ” ilhaam walay “ hai "
"1635","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` Umar raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke mein teen baaton mein apne Rab ke muwafiq hua aik muqaam Ibrahim mein namaz padhnay mein (jab mein ne raye di ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Aap us jagah ko jaye namaz banayie to waisa hi Quran mein utra) aur doosray auraton ke parday ke baaray mein aur teesray Badr ke qaidiyon ke baaray mein "
"1636","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` jab Abdullah bin Abu bin Salol mashhoor munafiq mara to us ka beta Abdullah raziyallahu anhu bin Abdullah bin Abu Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaya aur arz kiya ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam apna kurta mere baap ke kafan ke liye de dijiye to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne de diya phir us ne kaha ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam us par namaz janaza padha dijiye pas Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam us par namaz padhnay ko kharay hue Umar raziyallahu anhu ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka kapra thaama aur farmaya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! kiya Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam us par namaz padhtay hain halanke Allah Taala ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko us par namaz padhnay se mana kiya hai Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mujhe Allah Taala ne ikhtiyar diya hai ke ” to un ke liye dua karay ya na karay agar satr baar bhi dua karay ga to bhi Allah Taala un ko nahi bakhshay ga “ (Tauba : 80) to mein satr baar se zyada dua karun ga Umar raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke beshak wo munafiq tha pas Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us par namaz padhi tab ye aayat naazil ke ” mat namaz padh kisi munafiq par jo mar jaye aur mat khara ho us ki qabr par “ (Tauba : 84) (to Allah Taala ne Umar raziyallahu anhu ki raye ko pasand kiya) "
"1637","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam apne ghar mein laitay hue thay raanein ya pindliaan khole hue thay ke itnay mein Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ne ijazat maangi to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne usi haalat mein ijazat de di aur baatein kartay rahay phir Umar raziyallahu anhu ne ijazat chaahi to unhein bhi usi haalat mein ijazat de di aur baatein kartay rahay phir Usman raziyallahu anhu ne ijazat chaahi to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam baith gaye aur kapray barabar kar liye phir wo aaye aur baatein kein (rawi Muhammad kehta hai ke mein nahi kehta ke teenon ka aana aik hi din hua) jab wo chalay gaye to Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) aaye to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne kuch khayal na kiya phir Umar raziyallahu anhu aaye to bhi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne kuch khayal na kiya phir Usman raziyallahu anhu aaye to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam baith gaye aur apne kapray durust kar liye Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke kiya mein us shakhs se sharam na karun jis se farishtay sharam kartay hain "
"1638","[AI-translation] ´Sa'eed bin Musayyab kehtay hain ke` mujhe Abu Musa Ashari (raziyallahu anhu) ne khabar di ke unhon ne apne ghar mein wuzu kiya phir bahar niklay Abu Musa kehtay hain ke mein ne kaha ke aaj mein din bhar Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka saath na chhoron ga Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas hi rahun ga kehtay hain ke phir masjid mein aaya to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke baaray mein poocha logon ne kaha ke bahar us taraf tashreef le gaye hain mein bhi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke qadmon ke nishan par chala aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke baaray mein logon se poochta jata tha chaltay chaltay maloom hua ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam muqaam Arees par baagh mein gaye hain mein darwazay ke qareeb baith gaya jo khajoor ki daaliyon ka bana hua tha yahan tak ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam haajat se farigh hue aur wuzu kar chukay to mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki taraf chal diya mein ne dekha ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Arees kunwein ki munder par baithay hain aur donon pindliaan khol kar kunwein mein latka di hain pas mein ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko salam kiya aur phir laut kar darwazay ke qareeb baith gaya mein ne (dil mein) kaha ke mein aaj Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka darbaan / chaukidaar rahun ga itnay mein Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) aaye aur darwazay ko dhakaila mein ne poocha kaun hai unhon ne kaha ke Abu Bakr hun mein ne kaha zara thehro phir mein gaya aur kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Abu Bakr andar aanay ki ijazat chahtay hain Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke un ko aanay do aur jannat ki khushkhabri do mein aaya aur Abu Bakr se kaha ke andar daakhil ho aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Aap ko jannat ki khushkhabri di hai pas Abu Bakr daakhil hue aur Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki daahni taraf usi munder par donon paon latka kar pindliaan khol kar jaisay Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam baithay thay baith gaye mein laut aaya aur phir baith gaya aur mein apne bhai (Amir) ko ghar mein wuzu kartay chhor aaya tha mein ne kaha ke agar Allah Taala ko falan (yani) mere bhai ki bhalayi manzoor hai to us ko yahan le aaye ga itnay mein (kiya dekhta hun ke) koi darwaza hilanay laga hai mein ne poocha kaun hai jawab aaya ke Umar bin Khattab mein ne kaha thehar ja phir mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaya salam kiya aur kaha ke Umar bin Khattab andar aanay ki ijazat chahtay hain farmaya ke unhein ijazat do aur jannat ki khushkhabri bhi do pas mein gaya aur kaha ke andar daakhil ho aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne tujhe jannat ki khushkhabri di hai pas wo bhi daakhil hue aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke baayein taraf usi munder par baith gaye aur donon paon kunwein mein latka diye phir mein laut aaya aur (darwazay par) baith gaya mein ne kaha ke agar Allah ko falan aadmi (Amir) ki bhalayi manzoor hai to us ko bhi le aaye ga itnay mein aik aur aadmi ne darwaza hilaya mein ne kaha ke kaun hai jawab diya ke Usman bin Affan mein ne kaha ke thehar ja phir mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaya aur bataya to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke unhein ijazat do aur jannat ki khushkhabri do magar wo aik museebat mein mubtala hun ge mein aaya aur un se kaha ke daakhil ho aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne tujhe jannat ki khushkhabri di hai magar aik bila ke saath jo tum par aaye gi pas wo bhi daakhil hue aur dekha ke munder ka aik hissa bhar gaya hai pas wo doosray kinaaray par Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saamnay baith gaye shareek ne kaha ke Sa'eed bin Musayyab ne kaha ke mein ne us hadees se ye nikala ke un ki qabrein bhi usi tarah hun gi (waisa hi hua ke Usman raziyallahu anhu ko us hujra mein jagah na mili to wo Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saamnay Baqee mein dafan hue) "
"1639","[AI-translation] ´Fateh-e-Iran Sa'd bin Abu Waqqas (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ghazwa Tabook ke mauqa par Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ko (Madina mein) khaleefa banaya to unhon ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Aap mujhe auraton aur bachon mein chhoray jatay hain Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke kiya tum us baat se khush nahi hotay ke tumhara darja mere paas aisa ho jaisay Musa alaihissalam ke paas Haaroon alaihissalam ka tha lekin mere baad koi paighambar nahi hai "
"1640","[AI-translation] ´Sahl bin Sa'd (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Khaibar ki larai ke din farmaya ke mein ye jhanda us shakhs ko dun ga jis ke haath par Allah Taala fatah de ga aur wo Allah aur us ke Rasoolullah se mohabbat karta ho ga aur Allah aur Allah ke Rasoolullah us ko chahtay hun ge phir raat bhar log zikr kartay rahay ke dekhein ye shaan Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam kis ko detay hain jab subah hui to sab ke sab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas yehi umeed liye aaye ke ye jhanda mujhe milay ga Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ali bin Abu Talib kahan hain logon ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! un ki aankhein dukhti hain phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne unhein bila bheja aur un ki aankhon mein thook lagaya aur un ke liye dua ki to wo bilkul achay ho gaye goya un ko koi takleef na thi phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne unhein jhanda diya Chunanche Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! mein un se laron ga yahan tak ke wo hamari tarah (Musalman) ho jayein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke aahista chalta ja yahan tak ke un ke maidaan mein utray phir un ko Islam ki taraf bila aur un ko bata jo Allah ka haq un par wajib hai Allah ki qasam agar Allah Taala teri wajah se aik shakhs ko hidayat karay to wo tere liye surkh oonton se zyada behtar hai "
"1641","[AI-translation] ´Sahl bin Sa'd (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Madina mein Marwan ki aulad mein se aik shakhs haakim hua to us ne Sahl raziyallahu anhu ko bulaya aur Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ko gaali denay ka hukm diya Sahl raziyallahu anhu ne inkar kiya to wo shakhs bola ke agar to gaali denay se inkar karta hai to keh ke Abu Turaab par Allah ki lanat ho Sahl raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ko Abu Turaab se zyada koi naam pasand na tha aur wo us naam ke saath pukaarnay walay shakhs se khush hotay thay wo shakhs bola ke us ka qissa bayan karo ke un ka naam Abu Turaab kyun hua Sahl raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Fatima raziyallahu anha ke ghar tashreef laaye to Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ko ghar mein na paya Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne poocha ke tere chacha ka beta kahan hai wo bolein ke mujh mein aur un mein kuch baatein huein aur wo ghussa ho kar chalay gaye aur yahan nahi sauye Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aik aadmi se farmaya ke dekho wo kahan hain wo aaya aur bola ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Ali masjid mein sau rahay hain Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ke paas tashreef le gaye wo laitay hue thay aur chaadar un ke pehlu se alag ho gayi thi aur (un ke badan se) mitti lag gayi thi to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne wo mitti poonchhna shuru ki aur farmanay lagay ke Ae Abu Turaab ! uth Ae Abu Turaab ! uth "
"1642","[AI-translation] ´Usman kehtay hain ke` un dinon mein jab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam (kafiron se) lartay thay baaz din koi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath na raha siwae Talha aur Sa'd raziyallahu anhuma ke "
"1643","[AI-translation] ´Muhammad bin Munkadar Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat kartay hue kehtay hain ke` mein ne un ko ye kehtay hue suna ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Khandaq ke din logon ko jihad ki targheeb di Zubair raziyallahu anhu ne jawab diya ke haazir aur mustaed hun phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne bulaya to Zubair hi ne jawab diya phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne bulaya to Zubair hi ne jawab diya aakhir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke har paighambar ka aik khaas saathi hota hai aur mera khaas saathi Zubair hai "
"1644","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Zubair raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` mein aur Umar bin Abu Salama Khandaq ke din auraton ke saath Hassan bin saabit ke qila mein thay to kabhi wo mere liye jhuk jata aur mein dekhta aur kabhi mein us ke liye jhuk jata aur wo dekhta mein ne apne baap ko us waqt pehchan liya jab wo ghoray par hathiyar baandhay hue Bani Quraiza ki taraf niklay phir mein ne apne walid se us ka zikr kiya to unhon ne kaha ke beta tum ne mujhe dekha tha mein ne kaha ke haan unhon ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam us din Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mere liye apne maan baap ko jama kar diya aur farmaya ke tujh par mere maan baap qurban hun "
"1645","[AI-translation] ´Urwa bin Zubair kehtay hain ke` mujhe Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam tumharay donon baap (yani Zubair aur Abu Bakr) un logon mein se thay jin ka zikr us aayat mein hai yani ” jin logon ne zakhmi honay ke baad bhi Allah aur us ke Rasoolullah ki itaat ki (Abu Bakr Siddiq raziyallahu anhu Urwa ke naana thay aur Zubair raziyallahu anhu baap thay lekin naana ko bhi baap kehtay hain) aur aik riwayat mein hai ” yani Abu Bakr aur Zubair raziyallahu anhuma “ "
"1646","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Hira pahar par thay us (pahar) ka pathar hila to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tham ja Ae Hira ! tere upar nahi hai magar Nabi ya Siddiq ya shaheed aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath Abu Bakr aur Umar aur Ali aur Usman aur Talha aur Zubair raziyallahu anhum thay (Nabi to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam khud thay aur Siddiq Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) aur baaqi sab shaheed hue zulm se maaray gaye yahan tak ke Talha aur Zubair bhi) "
"1647","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` aik raat (kisi jang se wapas aatay hue) Madina ke rastay mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki aankh khul gayi aur neend uchaat ho gayi to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Kaash mere ashaab mein se koi naik bakht raat bhar meri hifazat karay Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke itnay mein hamein hathiyaron ki aawaz maloom hui to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke kaun hai aawaz aayi ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Sa'd bin Abu Waqqas hun Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tum kyun aaye wo bolay ke mujhe Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par apne nafs mein darr hua to mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki hifazat karnay ko aaya hun pas Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne un ke liye dua ki aur phir sau rahay "
"1648","[AI-translation] ´Amir bin Sa'd apne walid raziyallahu anhu se riwayat kartay hain ke` Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Uhud ke din apne walidain ko un ke liye jama kiya Sa'd raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke mushrikon mein se aik shakhs tha jis ne bohat se Musalmanon ko jala diya tha (yani bohat se Musalmanon ko shaheed kar diya tha) Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ” Ae Sa'd teer chalao tum par mere maan baap qurban hun “ mein ne us ke liye aik teer nikala jis mein paikaan na tha wo us ki pasli mein laga aur wo (mushrik) gir gaya to us ki sharmgah khul gayi Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam dekh kar hansay yahan tak ke mein ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke dandaan mubarak ko dekha "
"1649","[AI-translation] ´Mus'ab bin Sa'd apne walid raziyallahu anhu se riwayat kartay hain ke` un ke baaray mein Quran ki kai aayaat utarein wo kehtay hain ke un ki maan ne qasam khayi thi ke un se kabhi baat na karay gi jab tak wo apna deen (yani Islam ko) na chhorein ge aur na khaye gi na piye gi wo kehnay lagi ke Allah Taala ne tujhe maan baap ki itaat ka hukm diya hai aur mein teri maan hun aur tujhe us baat ka hukm karti hun phir teen din tak yun hi rahi kuch khaya na piya yahan tak ke us ko ghash aa gaya aakhir us ka aik beta jis ka naam Imara tha khara hua aur us ko pani pilaya pas wo Sa'd ke liye baddua karnay lagi to Allah Azza wa Jal ne Quran Majeed mein ye aayaat utaarein ke ” aur ham ne aadmi ko apne maan baap ke saath neki karnay ka hukm diya “ (al-Ankaboot : 8) lekin agar wo tujh par us baat ka zor daalein ke to mere saath us cheez ka shareek karay jis ka tujhe ilm nahi to un ki baat mat maan (yani shirk mat kar) aur un ke saath duniya mein dastoor ke muwafiq reh “ (Luqman : 5) aur aik baar Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko bohat sa maal ghaneemat haath aaya aur us mein aik talwaar bhi thi, wo mein ne le li aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas la kar arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! ye talwaar mujhe inaam de dijiye jabke mera haal Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jantay hi hain Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke us ko wahein rakh de jahan se to ne uthayi hai mein gaya aur mein ne qasd kiya ke phir us ko maal ghaneemat ke dhair mein daal dun lekin mere dil ne mujhe malamat ki aur mein phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas lota aur arz kiya ke ye talwaar mujhe de dijiye Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne sakhti se farmaya ke us ko usi jagah rakh de jahan se to ne uthayi hai tab Allah Taala ne ye aayat utari ke ” wo tujh se maal ghaneemat ke baaray mein poochtay hain “ (al-Anfaal : 1) Sa'd raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke mein beemar hua to mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko bila bheja Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam tashreef laaye to mein ne kaha ke mujhe ijazat dijiye ke mein apna maal jis ko chahun baant dun Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne na maana mein ne kaha ke acha aadha maal baant dun Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam na manay mein ne kaha ke acha tihayi maal baant dun Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam chup ho rahay phir yehi hukm hua ke tihayi maal baantna durust hai Sa'd raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke aik baar mein Ansaar aur Muhajireen ke kuch logon ke paas gaya to unhon ne kaha ke aao ham tumhein khana khilaayein ge aur sharaab pilayein ge aur us waqt tak sharaab haraam nahi hui thi mein un ke saath aik baagh mein gaya wahan aik oont ke sar ka gosht bhoona gaya tha aur sharaab ki aik mushk rakhi thi mein ne un ke saath gosht khaya aur sharaab pi wahan Muhajireen aur Ansaar ka zikr aaya to mein ne kaha ke Muhajireen Ansaar se behtar hain aik shakhs ne jabhray ki aik haddi li aur mujhe maara mere naak mein zakhm laga to mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se bayan kiya tab Allah Taala ne meri wajah se ye aayat utari ke ” sharaab juwa thaan aur paansay ye sab nijaasat hain aur shaitaan ke kaam hain “ (Maaida : 90)"
"1650","[AI-translation] ´Sa'd raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` ham chhe aadmi Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath thay mushrikon ne kaha ke Aap un logon ko apne paas se haank dijiye ye ham par jur'at na karein ge un logon mein mein tha bin Mas'ud thay aur aik shakhs Huzail ka tha aur Bilal aur do shakhs aur thay jin ka naam mein nahi leta Aap ke dil jo Allah ne chaha wo aaya pas Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne dil hi dil mein baatein kein tab Allah Taala ne ye aayat utari ke ” mat bhaga un logon ko jo apne Rab ko subah aur shaam ko pukaartay hain aur us ki razamandi chahtay hain “ (An'aam : 52) "
"1651","[AI-translation] ´Huzaifa (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Najran ke log Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaye aur kehnay lagay ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! hamaray paas aik amantdaar shakhs ko bhejye Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mein zaroor tumharay paas aik amantdaar shakhs ko bhejta hun beshak wo amantdaar hai beshak wo amantdaar hai rawi ne kaha ke log muntazir rahay ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam kis ko bhejtay hain to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Abu Ubaida bin Jarraah ko bheja "
"1652","[AI-translation] ´Salama bin Akwa (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein ne us safed khachar ko khaincha jis par Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aur Hasan raziyallahu anhu aur haseen raziyallahu anhu sawaar thay yahan tak ke un ko hujra Nabawi tak le gaya ye aik saahibzaday Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke aagay aur ye aik peechay thay "
"1653","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath din ko aik waqt mein nikla ke na Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam mujh se baat kartay thay aur na mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se baat karta tha (yani khamosh chalay jatay thay) yahan tak ke Bani Qainuqaa ke bazaar mein pahunche phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam lautay aur Fatima raziyallahu anha ke ghar par aaye aur poocha ke bacha hai bacha hai yani Hasan raziyallahu anhu ka pooch rahay thay ham samjhay ke un ki maan ne un ko rok rakha hai nehlaanay dhulaanay aur khushbu ka haar pehananay ke liye lekin thori hi dair mein wo daurtay hue aaye aur donon aik doosray se galay milay (yani Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aur Hasan raziyallahu anhu) phir Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ae Allah ! mein us se mohabbat karta hun to bhi us se mohabbat rakh aur us shakhs se mohabbat kar jo us se mohabbat karay "
"1654","[AI-translation] ´Miswar bin Makhrama raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke` Ali bin Abu Talib (raziyallahu anhu) ne Jahl ki beti ko (nikah ka) payaam diya aur un ke nikah mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki sahabzadi Fatima raziyallahu anha thin Fatima raziyallahu anha ne ye khabar suni to wo Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aayein aur arz kiya ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke baaray mein log kehtay hain ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam apni betion ke liye ghussa nahi hotay aur ye Ali raziyallahu anhu hain jo Jahl ki beti se nikah karnay walay hain Miswar raziyallahu anhu ne kaha Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne shahadatain ki adayigi ki aur phir farmaya ke mein ne apni larki (Zainab raziyallahu anha) ka nikah Abul Aas bin Rubayyi se kiya us ne jo baat mujh se kahi wo sach kahi aur Fatima bint Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mere gosht ka tukra hai aur mujhe bura lagta hai ke log us ko aazmaish mein daalein (yani jab Ali doosra nikah karein ge to shayad Fatima rashk ki wajah se koi baat apne shohar ke khilaf keh baithein ya un ki nafarmani karein aur gunahgaar hun) aur Allah ki qasam ! Allah ke Rasoolullah ki beti aur Allah ke dushman ki larki donon aik mard ke paas jama na hun gi ye sun kar Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ne payaam chhor diya (yani Jahl ki beti se nikah ka irada khatm kar diya) "
"1655","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki sab azwaaj mutahharat razi Allah anhunna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas thin (Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki beemari mein) koi biwi aisi na thin jo paas na ho ke itnay mein Fatima raziyallahu anha aayein aur wo bilkul usi tarah chalti thin jis tarah Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam chaltay thay Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne jab unhein dekha to marhaba kaha aur farmaya ke marhaba meri beti phir un ko apne daayein taraf ya baayein taraf bithaya aur un ke kaan mein aahista se kuch farmaya to wo bohat rooein jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne un ka ye haal dekha to dobara un ke kaan mein kuch farmaya to wo hansein mein ne un se kaha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne khaas tum se raaz ki baatein kein phir tum roti ho jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam kharay hue to mein ne un se poocha ke tum se Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne kiya farmaya unhon ne kaha ke mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka raaz faash karnay wali nahi hun jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki wafaat ho gayi to mein ne un ko qasam di us haq ki jo mera un par tha aur kaha ke mujh se bayan karo jo Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne tum se farmaya tha to unhon ne kaha ke ab albatta mein bayan karun gi pehli martaba Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mere kaan mein ye farmaya ke Jibrail alaihissalam har saal aik baar ya do baar mujh se Quran ka door kartay thay aur us saal unhon ne dobaar door kiya aur mein khayal karta hun ke mera (duniya se janay ka) waqt qareeb aa gaya hai pas Allah se darrti reh aur sabr kar mein tera bohat acha muntazir hun ye sun kar mein ronay lagi jaisay tum ne dekha tha jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mera rona dekha to dobara mujh se sargoshi ki aur farmaya ke Ae Fatima ! to us baat se raazi nahi hai ke to mominon ki auraton ki ya us ummat ki auraton ki sardar ho ye sun kar mein hansi jaisay ke tum ne dekha tha "
"1656","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam subah ko niklay aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aik chaadar orhay hue thay jis par kijaawon ki sooratein ya haandion ki sooratein Bani hui thin itnay mein Hasan raziyallahu anhu aaye to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne un ko us chaadar ke andar kar liya phir haseen raziyallahu anhu aaye to un ko bhi us mein daakhil kar liya phir Fatima raziyallahu anha aayein to un ko bhi unhi ke saath shaamil kar liya phir Ali (raziyallahu anhu) aaye to un ko bhi shaamil kar ke farmaya ke ” Allah Taala chahta hai ke tum se napaaki ko door karay aur tum ko paak karay Ae ghar walo ! “ (Ahzaab : 33) (us ka matlab ye nahi ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki azwaaj Aap ke ahl bait nahi jaisa ke Shi'a ka nazarya hai balke asal mein ahl bait to azwaaj hi hain jo ke aayat ka siyaaq bhi batata hai un ke saath saath Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Ali Fatima aur Hasnain raziyallahu anhum ko bhi shaamil kar liya hai) "
"1657","[AI-translation] ´Yazid bin Hayyaan kehtay hain ke` mein Husain bin Sabra aur Umar bin Muslim Zaid bin Arqam raziyallahu anhu ke paas gaye jab ham un ke paas baithay to Husain ne kaha ke Ae Zaid ! tum ne to bari neki hasil ki tum ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko dekha Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki hadees suni Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath jihad kiya Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath namaz padhi tum ne bohat sawab kamaya ham se bhi kuch hadees bayan karo jo tum ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suni ho unhon ne kaha ke Ae mere bhatijay ! meri Umar bohat bari ho gayi aur muddat guzari aur baaz baatein jin ko mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se yaad rakhta tha bhool gaya hun mein jo baat bayan karun us ko qabool karo aur jo mein na bayan karun us ke liye mujhe takleef na do phir Zaid raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aik din Makka aur Madina ke darmiyan waaqe muqaam ” Khumm “ ke pani ke muqaam par khutba sunanay ko kharay hue Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Allah ki hamd ki aur us ki tareef ko bayan kiya aur waz o nasihat ki phir farmaya ke us ke baad Ae logon ! mein aadmi hun qareeb hai ke mere Rab ka bheja hua (maut ka farishta) paigham ajal laaye aur mein qabool kar lun mein tum mein do bari cheezein chhoray jata hun pehle to Allah ki kitab hai aur us mein hidayat hai aur noor hai to Allah ki kitab ko thaamay raho aur us ko mazboot pakare raho gharz ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Allah ki kitab ki taraf raghbat dilayi phir farmaya ke doosri cheez mere ahl bait hain mein tumhein apne ahl bait ke baaray mein Allah Taala yaad dilata hun teen baar farmaya aur Husain ne kaha ke Ae Zaid ! Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke ahl bait kaun se hain kiya Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki azwaaj mutahharat ahl bait nahi hain Zaid raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke azwaaj mutahharat bhi ahl bait mein daakhil hain lekin ahl bait wo hain jin par zakaat haraam hai Husain ne kaha ke wo kaun log hain Zaid raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke wo Ali Uqail Jafar aur Abbas ki aulad hain Husain ne kaha ke un sab par sadqa haraam hai Zaid raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke haan "
"1658","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke` unhon ne kaha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : mein ne tujhe khwab mein teen raaton tak dekha ke aik farishta tujhe aik safed resham ke tukray mein laya aur mujhe kehnay laga ke ye Aap ki aurat hai mein ne tumharay chehray se kapra hataya to wo to hi nikli mein ne kaha ke agar ye khwab Allah Taala ki taraf se hai to aisa hi ho ga (yani ye aurat mujhe milay gi agar koi aur us khwab ki taabeer na ho)"
"1659","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` mujh se Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mein jaan leta hun jab to mujh se khush hoti hai aur jab naakhush hoti hai mein ne arz kiya ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam kaisay jaan letay hain Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke jab to khush hoti hai to kehti hai ke nahi Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke Rab ki qasam aur jab naraaz hoti hai to kehti hai ke nahi qasam hai Ibrahim (alaihissalam) ke Rab ki mein ne arz kiya ke beshak Allah ki qasam Ae Allah ke Rasool ! mein sirf Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka naam chhor deti hun (jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se naraaz hoti hun Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ka ye ghussa usi rashk ke baab se hai jo auraton ko maaf hai aur wo zaahir mein hota tha dil mein Aap kabhi Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se naraaz na hotein)"
"1660","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke` wo Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas guriyon se khailti thin unhon ne kaha ke meri saheliyaan aatein aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko dekh kar ghaib ho jatin (sharam aur darr se) to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam un ko mere paas bhej detay "
"1661","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke` log meri baari ka intezar kartay thay aur jis din meri baari hoti us din tohfay bhejtay taake Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam khush hun "
"1662","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki azwaaj mutahharat razi Allah anhunna ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki sahabzadi Fatima raziyallahu anha ko Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas bheja unhon ne ijazat maangi aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam mere saath meri chaadar mein laitay hue thay Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ijazat di to unhon ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki azwaaj mutahharat ne mujhe Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas bheja hai wo chahti hain ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam un ke saath Abu Quhafa ki beti mein insaaf karein (yani jitni mohabbat un se rakhtay hain itni hi auron se rakhein aur ye amr ikhtiyari na tha aur sab baaton mein to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam insaaf kartay thay) aur mein khamosh thi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ae beti ! kiya to wo nahi chahti jo mein chahun wo bolein ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! mein to wohi chahti hun jo Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam chahein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke to Aisha se mohabbat rakh ye suntay hi Fatima uthein aur azwaaj mutahharat ke paas gayein aur un se ja kar apna kehna aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka farmana bayan kiya wo kehnay lagein ke ham samajhteen hain ke tum hamaray kuch kaam na aayein us liye phir Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas jao aur kaho ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki azwaaj Abu Quhafa ki beti ke muqadma mein insaaf chahti hain (Abu Quhafa Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ke walid thay to Aisha raziyallahu anha ke dada hue aur dada ki taraf nisbat de saktay hain) Fatima raziyallahu anha ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam ! mein to ab Aisha raziyallahu anha ke muqadma mein kabhi Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se guftagu na karun gi Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke aakhir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki azwaaj ne Umm ul-Momineen Zainab bint Jahsh raziyallahu anha ko Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas bheja aur mere barabar ke martaba mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saamnay wohi thin aur mein ne koi aurat un se zyada deendaar Allah se darnay wali sachi baat kehnay wali naata jornay wali aur khairaat karnay wali nahi dekhi aur na un se barh kar koi aurat Allah Taala ke kaam mein aur sadqa mein apne nafs par zor daalti thi faqat un mein aik taizi thi (yani ghussa tha) us se bhi wo jaldi phir jatin aur mil jatin aur naadim ho jati thin unhon ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se ijazat chaahi to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne usi haal mein ijazat di ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam meri chaadar mein thay jis haal mein Fatima raziyallahu anha aayi thin unhon ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki azwaaj Abu Quhafa ki beti ke muqadma mein insaaf chahti hain phir ye keh kar mujh par aayein aur zubaan lambii ki aur mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki nigaah ko dekh rahi thi ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam mujhe jawab denay ki ijazat detay hain ya nahi yahan tak ke mujhe maloom ho gaya ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jawab denay se bura nahi manein ge tab to mein bhi un par aayi aur thori hi dair mein un ko laajawaab kar diya ya un par ghalib aa gayi Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam muskuraye aur farmaya ke ye Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ki beti hai (kisi aisay waisay ki larki nahi jo tum se dab jaye) "
"1663","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam (beemari mein) daryaft kartay thay aur farmatay thay ke mein aaj kahan hun ga mein kal kahan hun ga ye khayal kar ke ke abhi meri baari mein dair hai phir meri baari ke din Allah Taala ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko bila liya mere seena aur halaq se (yani Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka sar mubarak mere seena se laga hua tha) "
"1664","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke` unhon ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko apni wafaat se pehle farmatay hue suna aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam mere seena par tek lagao hue thay mein ne kaan lagaya to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke ” Ae Allah ! mujhe bakhsh de aur mujh par rehem kar aur mujhe apne rafeeqon se mila de “ "
"1665","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam apni tandrusti ki haalat mein farmatay thay ke koi Nabi faut nahi hua yahan tak ke us ne jannat mein apna thikana dekh nahi liya aur usay duniya se janay ka ikhtiyar nahi mila Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke jab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki wafaat ka waqt aa gaya to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka sar meri raan par tha Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aik sa'at tak behosh rahay phir hosh mein aaye aur apni aankh chhat ki taraf lagayi aur farmaya ke Ae Allah ! buland rafeeqon ke saath kar (yani paighambaron ke saath jo a'la illiyyeen mein rehtay hain) Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke us waqt mein ne kaha ke ab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hamein ikhtiyar karnay walay nahi aur mujhe wo hadees yaad aayi jo Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne tandrusti ki haalat mein farmayi thi ke koi Nabi faut nahi hua yahan tak ke us ne apna thikana jannat mein na dekh liya ho aur us ko (duniya mein rehnay aur aakhirat mein rehnay ka) ikhtiyar na mila ho Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke ye aakhri kalima tha jo Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ae Allah ! mujhe buland rafeeqon ke saath kar "
"1666","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jab safar ko jatay to apni azwaaj par qura daaltay aik baar qura mujh par aur Umm ul-Momineen Hafsa raziyallahu anha par aaya aur ham donon Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath niklein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jab raat ko safar kartay to Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ke saath saath un se baatein kartay hue chaltay Hafsa raziyallahu anha ne Aisha raziyallahu anha se kaha ke aaj raat tum mere oont par sawaar ho jao aur mein tumharay oont par sawaar hoti hun tum dekho gi jo tum nahi dekhti thin aur mein dekhon gi jo mein nahi dekhti thi Aisha raziyallahu anha ne kaha ke acha pas wo Hafsa raziyallahu anha ke oont par sawaar huein aur Hafsa raziyallahu anha un ke oont par raat ko Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ke oont ki taraf aaye jis par Hafsa raziyallahu anha sawaar thin Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne salam kiya aur un hi ke saath saath chalay yahan tak ke manzil par utray aur Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko (raat bhar) na paya to unhein ghairat aayi jab wo utarein to apne paon izkhir (ghaas) mein daalteen aur kehtin ke Ae Allah ! mujh par bichhu ya saanp musallat kar jo mujhe das le wo to tere Rasool hain mein un ko kuch nahi keh sakti "
"1667","[AI-translation] ´Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : mardon mein bohat log kaamil hue lekin auraton mein koi kaamil nahi hui siwae Maryam bint Imran aur Aasiya raziyallahu anha jo ke Fir'aun ki biwi thi aur Aisha raziyallahu anha ki fazeelat doosri auraton par aisi hai jaisay sareed ki fazeelat doosray khaanon par hai "
"1668","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ae Aisha ! ye Jibrail alaihissalam hain tumhein salam kehtay hain mein ne kaha ke ((wa alaihi salam wa rehmatullah Allah)) Aisha raziyallahu anha kehti hain ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam wo cheezein dekhtay thay jo mein nahi dekhti thi "
"1669","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` gyaara aurtein baithein aur un sab ne ye iqraar aur ehad kiya ke apne apne shoharon ki koi baat na chhupayein gi pehli aurat ne kaha ke mera shohar goya dublay oont ka gosht hai jo aik dushwaar guzaar pahar ki choti par rakha ho na to wahan tak saaf rasta hai ke koi charh jaye aur na wo gosht mota hai ke laya jaye doosri aurat ne kaha ke mein apne shohar ki khabar nahi phaila sakti mein darrti hun ke agar bayan karun to poora bayan na kar sakun gi kyunke us mein zaahiri o baatini uyoob bohat zyada hain (aur baaz ne ye maani kiye hain ke mein darrti hun ke agar bayan karun gi to us ko chhor dun gi yani wo khafa ho kar mujhe talaqein de ga aur us ko chhorna paray ga) teesri aurat ne kaha ke mera shohar lamba qad aur ahmaq hai agar mein us ki burayi bayan karun to mujhe talaqein de ga aur jo chup rahun to usi tarah muallaq rahun gi (yani na nikah ke mazay uthaon gi na bilkul mehroom rahun gi) chauthi ne kaha ke mera shohar to aisa hai jaisay Tihaama (Hijaaz aur Makka) ki raat na garam hai na sard hai (yani motadil ul mizaaj hai) na darr hai na ranj hai (ye us ki tareef ki yani us ke akhlaaq umda hain aur na wo meri sohbat se malool hota hai) paanchwin aurat ne kaha ke mera shohar jab ghar mein aata hai to cheeta hai (yani par kar sau jata hai aur kisi ko nahi sataata) aur jab bahar nikalta hai to sher hai aur jo maal asbaab ghar mein chhor jata hai us ko nahi poochta chhutti aurat ne kaha ke mera shohar agar khata hai to sab khatm kar deta hai aur peeta hai to talchhat tak nahi chhorta aur laitta hai to badan lapait leta hai aur mujh par apna haath nahi daalta ke mera dukh dard pehchane (ye bhi hajw hai yani siwa khanay peenay ke bail ki tarah aur koi kaam ka nahi aurat ki khabar tak nahi leta) saatwin aurat ne kaha ke mera shohar naamard hai ya shareer nihayat ahmaq hai ke kalaam karna nahi janta sab duniya bhar ke aib us mein maujood hain aisa zaalim hai ke tera sar phoray ya haath tore ya sar aur haath donon maroray aathwin aurat ne kaha ke mera shohar boo mein zarnab hai (zarnab aik khushboodaar ghaas hai) aur chhoonay mein narm jaisay khargosh (ye tareef hai yani us ka zaahir aur baatin donon achay hain) noein aurat ne kaha ke mera shohar oonchay mehal wala lambay partalay wala (yani qad aawar) aur bari raakh wala (yani sakhi hai) us ka baawarchi khana hamesha garam rehta hai to raakh bohat nikalti hai us ka ghar qaum ke mil baith kar mashwara karnay ki jagah (daira waghera) (yani sardar aur saahib ar-raai hai) daswin aurat ne kaha ke mere shohar ka naam Maalik hai aur Maalik kiya khoob hai Maalik meri us tareef se afzal hai us ke oonton ke bohat se shutarkhaanay hain aur kam tar charaagaahein hain (yani ziyaafat mein us ke yahan oont bohat zabah hua kartay hain us sabab se shutarkhaanon se jungle mein kam charnay jatay hain) jab oont baajay ki aawaz suntay hain to apne zabah honay ka yaqeen kar letay hain (ziyaafat mein raag aur baajay ka mamool tha us sabab se baajay ki aawaz sun kar oonton ko apne zabah honay ka yaqeen ho jata tha) giyaarhween aurat ne kaha ke mere shohar ka naam Abu Zar hai sau waah kiya khoob Abu Zar hai us ne zewar se mere donon kaan jhulaaye aur charbi se mere donon baazu bhare (yani mujhe mota kiya aur mujhe bohat khush kiya) sau meri jaan bohat chain mein rahi mujhe us ne bheer bakri walon mein paya jo pahar ke kinaaray rehtay thay pas us ne mujhe ghoray oont khait aur dhairiyon / khirman ka Maalik kar diya (yani mein nihayat zaleel aur mohtaaj thi us ne mujhe ba-izzat aur maaldaar kar diya) mein us ki baat karti hun to wo mujhe bura nahi kehta sauti hun to Fajr kar deti hun (yani kuch kaam nahi karna parta) aur piti hun to sairaab ho jati hun aur Abu Zar ki maan pas Abu Zar ki maan bhi kiya khoob hai us ki bari bari gathriyaan aur kushaada ghar hain Abu Zar ka beta pas Abu Zar ka beta bhi kiya khoob hai us ki khwab gaah jaisay talwaar ka miyaan (yani naazneen badan hai) us ko (bakri) halwaan ka haath aasooda (sair) kar deta hai (yani kam khor hai) Abu Zar ki beti pas Abu Zar ki beti bhi kiya khoob hai apne walidain ki taabedaar aur apne libaas ko bharnay wali (yani moti hai) aur apni sautan ki rashk (yani apne shohar ki pyaari hai us liye us ki sautan us se Jalti hai) aur Abu Zar ki londi Abu Zar ki londi bhi kiya khoob hai hamari baat zaahir kar ke mashhoor nahi karti aur hamara khana utha kar nahi lijaati aur hamara ghar kachray se aalooda nahi rakhti Abu Zar bahar nikla jab ke mashkon mein doodh (ghee nikaalnay) ke liye bulwaya ja raha tha pas wo aik aurat se mila jis ke saath us ke do larkay thay jaisay do cheetay us ki god mein do anaaron se kheltay hun pas Abu Zar ne mujhe talaqein di aur us aurat se nikah kar liya phir mein ne us ke baad aik sardar mard se nikah kiya jo aik umda ghoray ka sawaar aur naiza baaz hai us ne mujhe chaupaaye janwar bohat zyada diye aur us ne mujhe har aik mawaishee se jora jora diya aur us ne mujh se kaha ke Ae Umm Zar' ! khud bhi kha aur apne logon ko bhi khula pas agar mein wo cheezein jama karun jo mujhe doosray shohar ne dein to wo Abu Zar ke chotay bartan ke barabar bhi na pahunchein (yani doosray shohar ka ehsaan pehle shohar ke ehsaan se nihayat kam hai) Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mujh se farmaya ke mein tere liye aisa hun jaisay Abu Zar Umm Zar' ke liye tha (lekin na tujhe talaqein di hai aur na dun ga) "
"1670","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Jafar kehtay hain ke` mein ne Ali (raziyallahu anhu) se Kufa mein suna wo kehtay thay ke mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke (aasmaan o zameen ke andar) jitni aurtein hain sab mein Maryam bint Imran afzal hain aur (aasmaan aur zameen ke andar) jitni aurtein hain sab mein Khadija bint Khuwailid raziyallahu anha afzal hain Abu Kuraib ne kaha ke Waki ne aasmaan o zameen ki taraf ishara kiya "
"1671","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Jibrail alaihissalam Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaye aur kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! ye Khadija aik bartan le kar Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aa rahi hain us mein saalan hai ya khana hai ya bartan hai phir jab wo aayein to Aap un ko un ke Rab ki taraf se salam keye aur meri taraf se bhi aur un ko aik ghar ki khushkhabri dijiye jo jannat mein kholdaar mauti ka bana hua hai jis mein koi shor hai aur na koi takleef hai "
"1672","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` mein ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki azwaaj mein se kisi par rashk nahi kiya albatta Khadija raziyallahu anha par kiya aur mein ne un ko dekha nahi Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jab bakri zabah kartay to farmatay ke us ka gosht Khadija ki saheliyon ko bhejo aik din mein ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko naraaz kiya aur kaha ke Khadija Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mere dil mein us ki mohabbat daal di gayi hai "
"1673","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Khadeeja raziyallahu anha par doosra nikah nahi kiya yahan tak ke wo faut ho gayein "
"1674","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` Khadeeja raziyallahu anha ki behan Haala bint Khuwailid ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aanay ki ijazat maangi to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko Khadija raziyallahu anha ka ijazat maangna yaad aa gaya Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam khush hue aur farmaya ke ya Allah ! Haala bint Khuwailid mujhe rashk aaya to mein ne kaha ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam kiya Quraish ki boorhiyon mein se surkh masoorhon wali aik barhya ko yaad kartay hain (yani inteha ki barhya jis ke aik daant bhi na raha ho nari surkhi hi surkhi ho daant ki safedi bilkul na ho) jo muddat guzari faut ho chuki aur Allah Taala ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko us se behtar aurat di (jawan baakira jaisay mein hun) "
"1675","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne (apni azwaaj se) farmaya ke tum sab mein pehle wo mujh se milay gi jis ke haath zyada lambay hain pas sab azwaaj mutahharat ne apne apne haath naapay taake maloom ho ke kis ke haath zyada lambay hain Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke ham sab mein Zainab raziyallahu anha ke haath zyada lambay thay us liye ke wo apne haath se mehnat kartein aur sadqa deti thin "
"1676","[AI-translation] ´Usman Salman (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat kartay hain ke` unhon ne kaha ke agar ho sakay to sab se pehle bazaar mein mat ja aur na sab ke baad wahan se nikal kyunke bazaar shaitaan ka maidaan jang hai aur wahein wo apna jhanda gaarta hai unhon ne kaha mujhe khabar di gayi ke Jibrail alaihissalam Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaye aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas Umm Salama (raziyallahu anha) thin Jibrail alaihissalam Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se baatein karnay lagay phir kharay hue (yani chalay gaye) to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne un se poocha ke ye kaun shakhs thay unhon ne kaha ke Dihya Kalbi thay Umm Salama (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam ham to unhein Dihya Kalbi hi samjhay yahan tak ke mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka khutba suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hamari khabar bayan kartay thay mein (rawi hadees) ne kaha ke mein ne Usman se poocha ke ye hadees Aap ne kis se suni to unhon ne farmaya ke Usama bin Zaid (raziyallahu anhu) se "
"1677","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam kisi aurat ke ghar mein nahi jatay thay siwa apne azwaaj ke ya Umm Sulaim ke (jo Anas (raziyallahu anhu) ki walida aur Talha raziyallahu anhu ki biwi thin) Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Umm Sulaim ke paas jaya kartay thay logon ne us ki wajah poochi to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mujhe us par bohat rehem aata hai us ka bhai mere saath maara gaya "
"1678","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : mein jannat mein gaya wahan mein ne (kisi ke chalnay ki) aahat paayi to mein ne poocha ke kaun hai logon ne kaha ke Ghumaisa bint Malhaan (Umm Sulaim ka naam Ghumaisa ya Rumaisa tha) Anas bin Maalik ki walida hain "
"1679","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki wafaat ke baad Umar raziyallahu anhu se kaha ke hamaray saath Umm Aiman ki mulaqat ke liye challu ham us se milein ge jaisay Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam un se milnay ko jaya kartay thay jab ham un ke paas pahunche to wo ronay lagein donon saathiyon ne kaha ke tum kyun roti ho Allah Jal Jalaluhu ke paas apne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke liye jo samaan hai wo Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke liye behtar hai Umm Aiman raziyallahu anha ne kaha ke mein us liye nahi roti ke ye baat nahi jaanti balke us wajah se roti hun ke ab aasmaan se wahi ka aana band ho gaya Umm Aiman ke us kehnay se Abu Bakr aur Umar raziyallahu anhu ko bhi rona aaya pas wo bhi un ke saath ronay lagay "
"1680","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha ke` ham Zaid bin Harisa ko Zaid bin Muhammad kaha kartay thay (us wajah se ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne un ko munh bola beta kaha tha) yahan tak ke Quran mein utra ke ” un ko un ke baapon ki taraf nisbat kar ke pukaaro aur yehi Allah Taala ke qareeb acha hai “ (Ahzaab : 5) "
"1681","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam us waqt mimbar par thay ke agar tum us ki imaarat mein taan kartay ho (us se muraad Usama bin Zaid (raziyallahu anhu) thay) to beshak tum ne us se pehle us ke baap (Zaid) ki imaarat mein bhi taan kiya tha aur Allah ki qasam ! us ka baap sardari ke laiq tha aur sab logon mein wo mera zyada pyaara tha aur Allah ki qasam ye (yani Usama) bhi sardari ke laiq hai aur Allah ki qasam ! ab Usama us ke baad sab logon mein mujhe zyada pyaara hai lihaza mein tumhein wasiyat karta hun ke Usama ke saath acha sulook karna (kyun) ke wo tum mein naik bakht logon mein se aik hai "
"1682","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Bilal se subah ki namaz ke baad farmaya ke Ae Bilal ! mujh se wo amal bayan kar jo to ne Islam mein kiya hai aur jis ke faiday ki tujhe bohat umeed hai kyunke mein ne aaj ki raat teri jotion ki aawaz apne saamnay jannat mein suni hai Bilal raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke mein ne Islam mein koi amal aisa nahi kiya jis ke nafa ki umeed bohat ho siwa us ke ke raat ya din mein kisi bhi waqt jab poora wuzu karta hun to us wuzu se namaz padhta hun jitni ke Allah Taala ne meri qismat mein likhi hoti hai "
"1683","[AI-translation] ´A'iz bin Amr raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke` Salman Suhaib aur Bilal raziyallahu anhuma chand doosray logon mein baithay hue thay ke Sufyan un ke paas aaye pas wo kehnay lagay ke Allah ki talwarein Allah ke dushman ki gardan par apne mauqa par na pahunchein (yani Allah ka ye dushman na maara gaya) Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke tum Quraish ke boorhay aur sardar ke haq mein aisa kehtay ho (Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ne maslihat se aisa kaha ke kahein Sufyan naraaz ho kar Islam bhi qabool na karay) aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aa kar aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se bayan kiya to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ae Abu Bakr ! shayad tum ne un logon ko naraaz kiya hai (yani Salman aur Suhaib aur Bilal raziyallahu anhuma ko) agar tum ne un ko naraaz kiya to apne Rab ko naraaz kiya ye sun kar Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) un logon ke paas aaye aur kehnay lagay ke Ae bhaaiyo ! mein ne tumhein naraaz kiya wo bolay ke Ae hamaray bhai ! nahi Allah Taala tumhein bakhshay "
"1684","[AI-translation] ´Anas (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` meri maan mujhe Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas layi aur apni orhni ya dopatta ko do hisson mein phaar kar mujhe us mein se aadhi ka tehband bana diya tha aur aadhi upar ki chaadar aur kehnay lagi ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! ye Anas mera chota beta hai usay mein Aap ke paas Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki khidmat ke liye layi hun Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam us ke liye dua kijiye pas Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ae Allah ! us ke maal aur aulad mein kasrat farma Anas (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke mera maal bohat zyada hai aur aaj mere betay aur potay sau se zyada hain (us mein khaandaani mansooba bandi ka radd hai kyunke Islam zyada aulad ko acha samajhta hai)"
"1685","[AI-translation] ´Anas (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam guzar rahay thay ke meri maan Umm Sulaim raziyallahu anha ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki aawaz suni to kehnay lagi ke mere maan baap Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par qurban hun ye chota Anas hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mere liye teen duayein kein do to mein duniya mein paa chuka aur aik ki aakhirat mein umeed rakhta hun "
"1686","[AI-translation] ´saabit Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat kartay hain ke` unhon ne kaha mein (apne ham Umar) bachon ke saath khail raha tha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam mere paas tashreef laaye Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne hamein salam kiya aur mujhe kisi kaam ke liye bheja mein apni maan ke paas dair se gaya to meri maan ne kaha ke to ne dair kyun ki mein ne kaha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mujhe aik kaam ke liye bheja tha wo boli ke kiya kaam tha mein ne kaha ke wo bhaid hai meri maan boli ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka bhaid kisi se na kehna Anas (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam agar wo bhaid mein kisi se kehta to Ae saabit ! tujh se kehta "
"1687","[AI-translation] ´Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` ham Yaman mein thay ke hamein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke Makka se nikalnay ki khabar pahunchi pas ham bhi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki taraf hijrat kar ke rawana hue mein aur mere do bhai aik Burda aur doosray Abu Ruhm thay mein un se chota tha aur tirpan ya baawan ya kaha ke pachaas se kuch upar aadmi meri qaum mein se hamaray saath aaye Abu Musa kehtay hain ke ham sab jahaaz mein sawaar hue ittifaaq se ye jahaaz hamein Habsh ke mulk Najashi baadshah ke paas le gaya wahan hamein Jafar raziyallahu anhu bin Abu Talib aur un ke saathi milay Jafar raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke hamein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne yahan bheja hai aur hamein yahan theharnay ka hukm kiya hai pas tum bhi hamaray saath thehro pas ham ne un ke paas qayaam kiya phir ham sab ikathay rawana hue aur ham Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas us waqt pahunche jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Khaibar fatah kar chukay thay Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne wahan ke maal ghaneemat se hamara hissa lagaya aur Khaibar ki larai se jo shakhs ghaib tha us ko hissa na mila siwae hamari kashti walon ke aur baaz log hamein (yani ahl safeena se) kehnay lagay ke hijrat mein ham log tum par sabqat le gaye hain aur Asma bint Umais raziyallahu anha (jo hamaray saath aayi thin) Umm ul-Momineen Hafsa raziyallahu anha se milnay ko gayein aur unhon ne bhi Najashi ke mulk mein Muhajireen ke saath hijrat ki thi Umar raziyallahu anhu Umm ul-Momineen Hafsa raziyallahu anha ke paas aaye aur Asma bint Umais raziyallahu anha un ke paas maujood thin Umar raziyallahu anhu ne Asma raziyallahu anha ko dekh kar poocha ke ye kaun hai Umm ul-Momineen Hafsa raziyallahu anha ne jawab diya ke ye Asma bint Umais hai to unhon ne kaha ke jo Habsh ke mulk mein gayi thin aur ab samandar ka safar kar ke aayi hain Asma raziyallahu anha bolein ji haan mein wohi hun Umar raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke ham hijrat mein tum se sabqat le gaye lihaza Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par tum se zyada hamara haq hai ye sun kar unhein ghussa aa gaya aur kehnay lagein ” Ae Umar ! Allah ki qasam hargiz nahi tum ne jhoot kaha tum to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas maujood thay tum mein se bhooke ko khana khulatay aur tumharay jaahil ko nasihat kartay thay aur ham aik door lambi dushmanon ki zameen Habsha mein thay aur hamari ye sab takaaleef Allah aur us ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki raah mein thin Allah ki qasam ! mujh par us waqt tak khana pina haraam hai jab tak Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se tumhari baat ka zikr na kar lun aur ham ko eeza di jati thi aur hamein har waqt khauf rehta tha anqareeb mein Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se zikr karun gi un se poochon gi aur Allah ki qasam na mein jhoot bolon gi na mein kajrawi karun gi aur na mein us se zyada kahun gi “ jab Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam tashreef laaye to Asma (raziyallahu anha) ne arz kiya ke ya Nabi Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ! Umar raziyallahu anhu ne us us tarah kaha hai Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tum se zyada kisi ka haq nahi hai kyunke Umar (raziyallahu anhu) aur un ke saathiyon ki aik hijrat hai aur tum kashti walon ki to do hijratein huein (aik Makka se Habsh ko aur doosri Habsh se Madina tayyiba ko) Asma (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke mein ne Abu Musa aur kashti walon ko dekha ke wo giroh dar giroh mere paas aatay aur us hadees ko suntay thay aur duniya mein koi cheez un ko Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke us farman se zyada khushi ki na thi na itni bari thi Burda ne kaha ke Asma ne kaha ke mein ne Abu Musa ko dekha ke wo mujh se us hadees ko (khushi ke liye) baar sunna chahtay "
"1688","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Jafar (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jab safar se tashreef laatay to ham logon se miltay Abdullah bin Jafar kehtay hain ke aik baar mujh se milay aur Hasan ya haseen raziyallahu anhuma se to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ham mein se aik ko apne aagay bithaya aur aik ko peechay yahan tak ke Madina mein aaye "
"1689","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke` Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam bait al-khala mein (qaza-e haajat ke liye) gaye to mein ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke liye wuzu ka pani rakha Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jab bahar niklay to poocha ke ye pani kis ne rakha hai logon ne ya mein ne kaha ke bin Abbas ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ae Allah ! us ko deen mein samajh ataa farma "
"1690","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki hayaat mubarak mein jab koi shakhs khwab dekhta to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se bayan karta mujhe bhi aarzu thi ke mein bhi koi khwab dekhon aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se bayan karun aur mein jawan ghair shaadi shuda larka tha aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke zamanay mein masjid mein sauya karta tha mein ne khwab mein dekha ke jaisay do farishton ne mujhe pakra aur jahannam ki taraf le gaye dekha to wo paich dar paich kunwein ki tarah gehri hai aur us par do lakriyan hain jaisay kunwein par hoti hain us mein kuch log hain jin ko mein ne pehchana mein ne kehna shuru kiya ke mein jahannam se Allah ki panah maangta hun mein jahannam se Allah ki panah maangta hun teen dafa phir aik aur farishta mila aur wo bola ke tujhe kuch khauf nahi hai ye khwab mein ne Umm ul-Momineen Hafsa raziyallahu anha se bayan kiya pas unhon ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se bayan kiya pas Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Abdullah acha aadmi hai agar raat ko tahajjud padha karay Salim ne kaha ke Abdullah us ke baad raat ka kuch hissa hi sotay thay (aur tahajjud padha kartay) "
"1691","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Abu Mulaika kehtay hain ke` Abdullah bin Jafar raziyallahu anhu ne bin Zubair raziyallahu anhu se kaha ke tumhein yaad hai jab mein tum aur bin Abbas Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se milay thay to bin Zubair raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke haan aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne hamein sawaar kar liya tha aur tumhein chhor diya tha (us liye ke sawaari par zyada jagah na ho gi) "
"1692","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` jab ye aayat naazil hui ke ” jo log iman laaye aur naik amal kiye un par gunah nahi us ka jo kha chukay .... “ aakhir tak to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mujh se kaha ke mujhe kaha gaya hai ke to un logon mein se hai (yani iman walon aur naik aamaal walon mein se) "
"1693","[AI-translation] ´Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein aur mera bhai donon Yaman se aaye to aik zamanay tak ham Abdullah bin Mas'ud aur un ki walida ko Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke ahl bait mein se samajhtay thay kyunke wo Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas bohat jatay aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath rehtay thay "
"1694","[AI-translation] ´Abu Ahwas kehtay hain ke` ham Abu Musa raziyallahu anhu ke ghar mein thay aur wahan Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) ke kai saathi thay aur aik Quran Majeed dekh rahay thay ke itnay mein Abdullah raziyallahu anhu kharay hue Abu Mas'ud ne kaha ke mein nahi janta ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apne baad Quran ka jannay wala us shakhs se zyada koi chhora ho jo khara hai Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke agar tum ye kehtay ho (to sahih hai) aur un ka ye haal tha ke jab ham ghaib hotay to ye haazir rehtay aur jab ham rokay jatay to un ko (Rasoolullah ke paas janay ki) ijazat milti "
"1695","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke` unhon ne kaha ke ” aur jo koi cheez chhupa rakhay ga wo us ko qayamat ke din laaye ga “ (Surah : aal Imran : 161) phir kaha ke tum mujhe kis shakhs ki qiraat ki tarah Quran padhnay ka hukm kartay ho mein ne to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saamnay satr se zyada surtein padhein aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke ashaab ye jantay hain ke mein un sab mein Allah ki kitab ko zyada janta hun aur agar mein janta ke koi mujh se zyada Allah ki kitab ko janta hai to mein us shakhs ki taraf safar ikhtiyar karta Shaffeeq ne kaha ke mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke ashaab ke halaqon mein baitha hun mein ne kisi ko Abdullah raziyallahu anhu ki us baat ko radd kartay ya un par aib lagatay nahi suna "
"1696","[AI-translation] ´Masrooq kehtay hain ke` ham Abdullah bin Amr (raziyallahu anhuma) ke paas thay ke ham ne Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) ka zikr kiya to unhon ne kaha ke tum ne aik aisay shakhs ka zikr kiya jis se mein (us waqt se) mohabbat karta hun jab se mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se aik hadees suni hai mein ne suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke tum Quran chaar aadmiyon se seekho aik Umm Abd ke betay (yani Abdullah bin Mas'ud) se aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne un hi se shuru kiya aur Abu bin Ka'b se aur Salim maula Abu Huzaifa se aur Muaz bin Jabal raziyallahu anhuma se "
"1697","[AI-translation] ´Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mera baap Uhud ke din shaheed hua to mein us ke munh se kapra uthata tha aur rota tha log mujhe mana kartay thay aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam mana na kartay thay aur Amr ki beti Fatima (yani meri phuphi) wo bhi us par ro rahi thi Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke to roye ya na roye tumharay usay uthanay tak farishtay us par apne paron ka saya kiye hue thay "
"1698","[AI-translation] ´Amir bin Sa'd kehtay hain ke` mein ne apne walid raziyallahu anhu se suna wo kehtay thay ke mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se kisi zinda shakhs ke liye jo chalta phirta ho ye nahi suna ke wo jannat mein hai magar Abdullah bin salam raziyallahu anhu ke liye (ye un ki apni ma'loomaat hain warna bohat se sahaba kiraam ko jannat ki khushkhabri mili hai masalan ashray mubashshara waghera) "
"1699","[AI-translation] ´Kharsha bin hurr kehtay hain ke` mein Madina ki masjid mein aik halqa mein baitha hua tha aik khoobsurat boorha bhi wahan tha maloom hua ke wo Abdullah bin salam raziyallahu anhu hain wo logon se achi achi baatein kar rahay thay jab wo kharay hue to logon ne kaha ke jis ko aik jinti ka dekhna acha maloom ho wo us ko dekhay mein ne (apne dil mein) kaha ke Allah ki qasam mein un ke saath jaun ga aur un ka ghar dekhon ga phir mein un ke peechay hua wo chalay yahan tak ke qareeb hua ke wo sheher se bahar nikal jayein phir wo apne makaan mein gaye to mein ne bhi andar aanay ki ijazat chaahi unhon ne ijazat di phir poocha ke Ae mere bhatijay ! tujhe kiya kaam hai mein ne kaha ke jab Aap kharay hue to mein ne logon ko suna ke jis ko aik jinti ka dekhna acha lagay wo un ko dekhay to mujhe Aap ke saath rehna acha maloom hua unhon ne kaha ke jannat walon ko Allah Taala janta hai aur mein tujh se logon ke ye kehnay ki wajah bayan karta hun mein aik dafa sau raha tha ke khwab mein aik shakhs aaya aur us ne kaha ke khara ho phir us ne mera haath pakra mein us ke saath chala mujhe baayein taraf kuch raahein milein to mein ne un mein jana chaha to wo bola ke un mein mat ja ye baayein taraf walon (yani kafiron) ki raahein hain phir daayein taraf ki raahein milein to wo shakhs bola ke un raahon mein ja pas wo mujhe aik pahar ke paas le aaya aur bola ke us par charh mein ne upar charhna chaha to peeth ke bal gira kai baar mein ne charhnay ka qasd kiya lekin har baar gira phir wo mujhe le chala yahan tak ke aik sutoon mila jis ki choti aasmaan mein thi aur teh zameen mein us ke upar aik halqa tha mujh se us shakhs ne kaha ke us sutoon ke upar charh ja mein ne kaha ke mein us par kaisay charhon ke us ka sara to aasmaan mein hai aakhir us shakhs ne mera haath pakra aur mujhe uchhaal diya aur mein ne dekha ke mein us halqa ko pakare hue latak raha hun phir us shakhs ne sutoon ko maara to wo gir para aur mein subah tak usi halqa mein latakta raha (us wajah se ke utarnay ka koi zariya nahi raha) kehtay hain pas mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aa kar apna khwab bayan kiya to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke jo raahein to ne baayein taraf dekhein wo baayein taraf walon ki raahein hain aur jo raahein daayein taraf dekhein wo daayein taraf walon ki raahein hain aur wo pahar shaheedon ka muqaam hai to wahan tak na pahunch sakay ga aur sutoon Islam ka sutoon hai aur halqa Islam ka halqa hai aur to martay dam tak Islam par qaim rahay ga (aur jab Islam par khaatima ho to jannat ka yaqeen hai us wajah se log mujhe jinti kehtay hain)"
"1700","[AI-translation] ´Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya aur us waqt Sa'd bin Muaz raziyallahu anhu ka janaza saamnay rakha tha ke un ke wastay Rab ka arsh jhoom gaya "
"1701","[AI-translation] ´Bara (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aik reshmi jora tohfa aaya to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke sahaba us ko chhoonay lagay aur us ki narmi se taajjub karnay lagay Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tum us ki narmi se taajjub kartay ho albatta Sa'd bin Muaz raziyallahu anhu ke ro maal jannat mein us se behtar aur us se zyada narm hain "
"1702","[AI-translation] ´Anas (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Talha raziyallahu anhu ka aik beta jo Umm Sulaim raziyallahu anha ke batn se tha faut ho gaya unhon ne apne ghar walon se kaha ke jab tak mein khud na kahun Talha ko un ke betay ki khabar na karna aakhir Talha raziyallahu anhu aaye to Umm Sulaim shaam ka khana saamnay laayein unhon ne khaya aur piya phir Umm Sulaim raziyallahu anha ne un ke liye achi tarah banao aur singhaar kiya yahan tak ke unhon ne un se jima kiya jab Umm Sulaim ne dekha ke wo sair ho chukay aur un ke saath sohbat bhi kar chukay to us waqt unhon ne kaha ke Ae Talha ! agar kuch log apni cheez kisi ghar walon ko maangay par dein phir apni cheez maangein to kiya ghar walay us ko rok saktay hain Talha raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke nahi rok saktay Umm Sulaim raziyallahu anha ne kaha ke apne betay ke iwaz Allah Taala se sawab ki umeed rakho (kyunke beta to faut ho chuka tha) ye sun kar Talha ghussay hue aur kehnay lagay ke tum ne mujhe chhoray rakha yahan tak ke mein tumharay saath aalooda hua (yani jima kiya) to ab mujhe betay ke mutaliq khabar de rahi ho wo gaye aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas ja kar Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko khabar ki Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Allah Taala tumhari guzari hui raat mein tumhein barkat de Umm Sulaim raziyallahu anha hamila ho gayein kehtay hain Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam safar mein thay Umm Sulaim bhi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath thin aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jab safar se Madina mein tashreef laatay to raat ko Madina mein daakhil na hotay jab log Madina ke qareeb pahunche to Umm Sulaim ko dard zah shuru hua aur Talha un ke paas thehray rahay aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam tashreef le gaye Talha kehtay hain ke Ae Rab ! to janta hai ke mujhe ye baat pasand hai ke jab tera Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam niklay to saath mein bhi nikalon aur jab Madina mein wapas daakhil ho to mein bhi saath daakhil hun lekin to janta hai mein jis wajah se ruk gaya hun Umm Sulaim ne kaha ke Ae Talha ! ab mere waisa dard nahi hai jaisay pehle tha to challu ham chalay jab donon Madina mein aaye to phir Umm Sulaim ko dard shuru hua aur unhon ne aik larkay ko janam diya meri maan ne kaha ke Ae Anas ! us ko koi us waqt tak doodh na pulaye jab tak to subah ko us ko Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas na le jaye jab subah hui to mein ne bacha ko uthaya aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas laya mein Aap ke paas pahuncha to dekha ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke haath mein oonton ke daaghnay ka aala hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne jab mujhe dekha to farmaya ke shayad Umm Sulaim ne larkay ko janam diya hai mein ne kaha ke haan Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne wo aala haath mubarak se rakh diya aur mein bacha ko la kar Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki god mein bitha diya Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ajwa khajoor Madina ki mangwayi aur apne munh mubarak mein chabaayi jab wo ghul gayi to bacha ke munh mein daal di bacha us ko choosnay laga to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke dekho Ansaar ko khajoor se kaisi mohabbat hai phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us ke munh par haath phera aur us ka naam Abdullah rakha "
"1703","[AI-translation] ´Anas (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke zamanay mein chaar shakhson ne Quran ko jama kiya aur wo chaaron Ansari thay Muaz bin Jabal Abu bin Ka'b Zaid bin saabit aur Abu Zaid raziyallahu anhuma Qatada ne kaha ke mein ne Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se kaha ke Abu Zaid kaun hai unhon ne kaha ke mere chachaon mein se aik thay "
"1704","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Samit kehtay hain ke` Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke mein mera bhai Unees aur hamari maan teenon apni qaum Ghaffar mein se niklay jo haraam maheena ko bhi halal samajhtay thay pas ham apne aik maamon ke paas utray us ne hamari khaatir ki aur hamaray saath neki ki to us ki qaum ne ham se hasad kiya aur (hamaray maamon se) kehnay lagay ke jab to apne ghar se bahar nikalta hai to Unees teri bi bi ke saath zina karta hai wo hamaray paas aaya aur us ne ye baat (himaaqat se) mashhoor kar di mein ne kaha ke to ne hamaray saath jo ehsaan kiya tha wo bhi kharaab ho gaya hai ab ham tere saath nahi reh saktay aakhir ham apne oonton ke paas gaye aur apna asbaab laada aur hamaray maamon ne apna kapra orh kar rona shuru kar diya ham chalay yahan tak ke Makka ke saamnay utray Unees ne hamaray oonton ke saath itnay hi aur ki shart lagayi phir donon kaahin ke paas gaye to kaahin ne Unees ko kaha ke ye behtar hai pas Unees hamaray paas saaray oont aur itnay hi aur oont laya Zarr ne kaha ke Ae mere bhai ke betay ! mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki mulaqat se pehle teen baras pehle namaz padhi hai mein ne kaha ke kis ke liye padhtay thay Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Allah Taala ke liye mein ne kaha ke kidhar munh kartay thay unhon ne kaha ke idhar munh karta tha jidhar Allah Taala mera munh kar deta tha mein raat ke aakhir hissa mein Isha ki namaz padhta aur sooraj tuloo honay tak kambal ki tarah par rehta tha Unees ne kaha ke mujhe Makka mein kaam hai tum yahan raho mein jata hun wo gaya aur us ne aanay mein dair ki phir aaya to mein ne kaha ke to ne kiya kiya wo bola ke mein Makka mein aik shakhs se mila jo tere deen par hai aur wo kehta hai ke Allah Taala ne us ko bheja hai mein ne kaha ke log usay kiya kehtay hain us ne kaha ke log us ko shaair kaahin aur jadugar kehtay hain aur Unees khud bhi shaair tha us ne kaha ke mein ne kahinon ki baat suni hai lekin jo kalaam ye shakhs padhta hai wo kahinon ka kalaam nahi hai aur mein ne us ka kalaam shair ke tamam behron par rakha to wo kisi ki zubaan par mere baad shair ki tarah na jare ga Allah ki qasam wo sacha hai aur log jhootay hain mein ne kaha ke tum yahan raho mein us shakhs ko ja kar dekhta hun phir mein Makka mein aaya to mein ne aik naatawan shakhs ko Makka walon mein se chhaanta (us liye ke taaqatwar shakhs shayad mujhe koi takleef pahunchaye) aur us se poocha ke wo shakhs kahan hai jis ko tum saabi (bedeen) kehtay ho us ne meri taraf ishara kiya aur kaha ke ye saabi hai (jab to saabi ka poochta hai) ye sun kar tamam waadi walon ne dheelay aur haddiaan le kar mujh par hamla kar diya yahan tak ke mein behosh ho kar gir para jab mein hosh mein aa kar utha to kiya dekhta hun ke goya mein laal but hun (yani sar se peer tak khoon se surkh hun) phir mein Zamzam ke paas aaya aur mein ne sab khoon dhoya aur Zamzam ka pani piya pas Ae mere bhatijay ! mein wahan tees raatein ya tees din raha aur mere paas siwae Zamzam ke pani ke koi khana na tha (jab bhook lagti to mein usi ko peeta) phir mein mota ho gaya yahan tak ke mere pait ki batein (motapay se) jhuk gayein aur mein ne apne kalaiji mein bhook ki naatwaani nahi paayi aik baar Makka walay chaandni raat mein sau gaye ke us waqt bait Allah ka tawaaf koi na karta tha sirf do aurtein Isaaf aur Naila ko pukaar rahi thin (Isaaf aur Naila Makka mein do but thay Isaaf mard tha aur Naila aurat thi aur kuffaar ka ye i'tiqaad tha ke un donon ne wahan zina kiya tha us wajah se maskh ho kar but ho gaye thay) wo tawaaf karti karti mere saamnay aayein mein ne kaha ke aik ka nikah doosray se kar do (yani Isaaf ka Naila se) ye sun kar bhi wo apni baat se baaz na aayein phir mein ne saaf keh diya ke un ke falan mein lakri (yani ye fuhsh Isaaf aur Naila ki parastish ki wajah se) aur mein ne kinaaya na kiya (yani kinaaya ishara mein mein ne gaali nahi di balke un mardood auraton ko ghussa dilanay ke liye Isaaf aur Naila ko khullam khula gaali di jo Allah Taala ke ghar mein Allah ko chhor kar Isaaf aur Naila ko pukaarti thin) ye sun kar wo donon aurtein chalati aur kehti hui chalein ke Kaash us waqt hamaray logon mein se koi hota (jo us shakhs ko be adabi ki saza deta) raah mein un auraton ko Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aur Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) milay aur wo pahar se utar rahay thay unhon ne auraton se poocha ke kiya hua wo bolein ke aik saabi aaya hai jo Kaaba ke pardon mein chhupa hua hai unhon ne kaha ke us saabi ne kiya kaha wo bolein ke aisi baat bola jis se munh bhar jata hai (yani us ko zubaan se nahi nikaal saktein) aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam tashreef laaye yahan tak Hajar-e-Aswad ko bosa diya aur apne saathi ke saath tawaaf kiya aur namaz padhi jab namaz padh chukay to Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke awwal mein ne hi salam ki sunnat ada ki aur kaha ke salam alaikum Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke wa alaik wa rehmatullah Allah phir poocha ke to kaun hai mein ne kaha ke Ghaffar ka aik shakhs hun Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne haath jhukaya aur apni ungliyan peshani par rakhein (jaisay koi zikr karta hai) mein ne apne dil mein kaha ke shayad Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko ye kehna bura maloom hua ke mein (qabeela) Ghaffar mein se hun mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka haath pakarnay ko lapka lekin Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saathi (Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu)) ne jo mujh se zyada Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka haal jantay thay mujhe roka phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne sar uthaya aur farmaya ke to yahan kab aaya mein ne arz kiya mein yahan tees raat ya din se hun Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tujhe khana kaun khulata hai mein ne kaha ke khana waghera kuch nahi siwae Zamzam ke pani ke phir mein mota ho gaya yahan tak ke mere pait ke butt mur gaye aur mein apne kalaiji mein bhook ki naatwaani nahi pata Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Zamzam ka pani barkat wala hai aur wo khana bhi hai aur khanay ki tarah pait bhar deta hai Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! aaj ki raat us ko khulanay ki ijazat mujhe dijiye phir Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam chalay aur Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) bhi mein bhi un donon ke saath chala Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ne aik darwaza khola aur us mein se Taif ki sookhi hui kishmish nikaalein ye pehla khana tha jo mein ne Makka mein khaya phir mein raha jab tak ke raha us ke baad Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaya to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mujhe aik khajoor wali zameen dikhayi gayi hai mein samajhta hun ke wo zameen Yasrib ke siwa koi aur nahi hai (Yasrib Madina ka naam tha) pas to meri taraf se apni qaum ko deen ki dawat de shayad Allah Taala un ko teri wajah se nafa de aur tujhe sawab de mein Unees ke paas aaya to us ne poocha ke to ne kiya kiya mein ne kaha ke mein Islam laya aur mein ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki nabuwwat ki tasdeeq ki wo bola ke tumharay deen se mujhe bhi nafrat nahi hai mein bhi Islam laya aur mein ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki nabuwwat ki tasdeeq ki phir ham donon apni maan ke paas aaye wo boli ke mujhe bhi tum donon ke deen se nafrat nahi hai mein bhi Islam layi aur mein ne tasdeeq ki phir ham ne oonton par asbaab laada yahan tak ke ham apni qaum Ghaffar mein pahunche aadhi qaum to Musalman ho gayi aur un ka Imam Eema bin Rahza Ghaffari tha wo un ka sardar bhi tha aur aadhi qaum ne ye kaha ke jab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Madina mein tashreef laayein ge to ham Musalman hun ge phir Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Madina mein tashreef laaye aur aadhi qaum jo baaqi thi wo bhi Musalman ho gayi aur (qabeela) Aslam ke log aaye aur unhon ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! ham bhi apne Ghaffari bhaiyon ki tarah Musalman hotay hain to wo bhi Musalman ho gaye tab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ghaffar ko Allah ne bakhsh diya aur Aslam ko Allah Taala ne (qatl aur qaid se) bacha diya "
"1705","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` jab Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) ko Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke Makka mein mab'oos honay ki khabar pahunchi to unhon ne apne bhai se kaha ke sawaar ho kar us waadi ko ja aur us shakhs ko dekh kar aa jo kehta hai mujhe aasmaan se khabar aati hai un ki baat sun phir mere paas aa wo rawana hua yahan tak ke Makka mein aaya aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka kalaam suna phir Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) ke paas laut kar gaya aur bola ke mein ne us shakhs ko dekha wo achi khaslaton ka hukm karta hai aur aik kalaam sunata hai jo shair nahi hai Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke mujhe us se tasalli nahi hui phir unhon ne khud zaad-e-raah liya aur pani ki aik mushk li yahan tak ke Makka mein aaye aur Masjid-ul-Haram mein daakhil hue wahan Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko dhoonda aur wo Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko pehchantay na thay aur unhon ne poochna bhi munasib na jana yahan tak ke raat ho gayi aur wo lait rahay Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ne un ko dekha aur pehchana ke koi musafir hai phir un ke peechay gaye lekin kisi ne doosray se baat nahi ki yahan tak ke subah ho gayi phir wo apna tosha aur mushk masjid mein utha laaye aur saara din wahan rahay aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko shaam tak na dekha phir wo apne sonay ki jagah mein chalay gaye wahan se Ali (raziyallahu anhu) guzray aur kaha ke abhi wo waqt nahi aaya ke us shakhs ko apna thikana maloom ho phir un ko khara kiya aur un ko saath le gaye lekin kisi ne doosray se baat na ki phir teesray din bhi aisa hi hua aur Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ne un ko apne saath khara kiya phir kaha ke tum mujh se wo baat kyun nahi kehtay jis ke liye tum us sheher mein aaye ho Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke agar tum mujh se ehad aur waada kartay ho ke raah batlao ge to mein batata hun Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ne waada kiya to unhon ne bataya Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke wo shakhs sache hain aur wo beshak Allah Taala ke Rasool hain aur tum subah ko mere saath chalna agar mein koi khauf ki baat dekhon ga jis mein tumhari jaan ka darr ho to mein khara ho jaun ga jaisay koi pani bahata hai (yani peshaab ka bahaana karun ga) aur agar chala jaun to tum bhi mere peechay peechay chalay aana jahan mein ghuson wahan tum bhi ghus aana Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) ne aisa hi kiya aur un ke peechay peechay chalay yahan tak ke Ali (raziyallahu anhu) Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas pahunche aur Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) bhi un ke saath pahunche phir Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki baatein sunein aur usi jagah Musalman hue aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke apni qaum ke paas ja aur un ko deen ki khabar kar yahan tak ke mera hukm tujhe pahunche Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke qasam us ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai ke mein to ye baat (yani deen qabool karnay ki) Makka walon ko pukaar kar suna dun ga phir Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) nikal kar masjid mein aaye aur chala kar bolay ke ” mein gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood barhaq nahi hai aur Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Allah ke sache Rasool hain “ logon ne un par hamla kiya aur un ko maartay maartay luta diya Abbas raziyallahu anhu wahan aaye aur Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) par jhukay aur logon se kaha ke tumhaai kharaabi ho tum nahi jantay ke ye shakhs (qaum) Ghaffar ka hai aur tumhara saudaagari ka rasta shaam ki taraf (qaum) Ghaffar ke mulk par se hai (to wo tumhari tijaarat band kar dein ge) phir Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) ko un logon se chhura liya Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) ne doosray din phir waisa hi kiya aur log dauray aur maara aur Abbas raziyallahu anhu aaye aur unhein chhura liya "
"1706","[AI-translation] ´Abu Musa Ashari (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas tha aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam us waqt Makka aur Madina ke darmiyan (muqaam) Jirana mein thay aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath Bilal raziyallahu anhu thay pas Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aik dehati aaya aur kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Aap mere saath apna waada poora nahi kartay Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke khush ho ja wo bola ke Aap bohat farmatay hain ke khush ho ja phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Abu Musa aur Bilal raziyallahu anhuma ki taraf ghussay ki haalat mein mutawajjah hue aur farmaya ke us ne khushkhabri ko radd kiya aur tum qabool karo donon ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! ham ne qabool kiya phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne pani ka aik pyala mangwaya aur donon haath aur munh us mein dhoye aur us mein lu'aab dahan daal kar donon se kaha ke us pani ko pi lo aur apne munh aur seenay par daalo aur khush ho jao un donon ne pyala le kar aisa hi kiya Umm Salama (raziyallahu anha) ne un ko parda ki aar se aawaz di ke bartan mein se apni maan ke liye bhi kuch pani bacha lao pas un donon ne us bartan mein kuch pani un ke liye bacha diya "
"1707","[AI-translation] ´Burda apne walid Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat kartay hain ke` jab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Hunain ki larai se farigh hue to Abu Aamir raziyallahu anhu ko lashkar de kar Autaas par bheja to un ka muqabla Duraid bin as-Samma se hua pas Duraid bin as-Samma qatl kar diya gaya aur us ke saath walon ko Allah Taala ne shikast se hamkinaar kar diya Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke mujhe bhi Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Abu Aamir raziyallahu anhu ke saath bheja tha phir Bani Jashm ke aik shakhs ka aik teer Abu Aamir raziyallahu anhu ko ghutnay mein laga aur wo un ke ghutnay mein jam gaya mein un ke paas gaya aur poocha ke Ae chacha ! tumhein ye teer kis ne maara unhon ne kaha ke us shakhs ne mujhe qatl kiya aur usi shakhs ne mujhe teer maara hai Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke mein ne us shakhs ka peecha kiya aur us se ja mila us ne jab mujhe dekha to peeth mor kar bhaag khara ho mein us ke peechay hua aur mein ne kehna shuru kiya ke Ae behayaa ! kiya to Arab nahi hai theharta nahi hai pas wo ruk gaya phir mera us ka muqabla hua us ne bhi waar kiya aur mein ne bhi waar kiya aakhir mein ne us ko talwaar se maar daalnay phir laut kar Abu Aamir raziyallahu anhu ke paas aaya aur kaha ke Allah ne tumharay qaatil ko qatl karwa diya Abu Aamir raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke ab ye teer nikaal le mein ne us ko nikala to teer ki jagah se pani nikla (khoon na nikla shayad wo teer zehar aalood tha) Abu Aamir ne kaha ke Ae mere bhatijay ! to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas ja kar meri taraf se salam keh aur ye kehna ke Abu Aamir ki bakhshish ki dua kijiye Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Abu Aamir raziyallahu anhu ne mujhe logon ka sardar kar diya aur wo thori dair zinda rahay phir faut ho gaye jab mein laut kar Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaya to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aik kothri mein baan ke aik palang par thay jis par farsh tha aur baan ka nishan Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki peeth aur pehluon par bin gaya tha mein ne kaha ke Abu Aamir ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se ye darkhwast ki thi ke mere liye dua kijiye pas Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne pani mangwaya kar wuzu kiya phir donon haath uthaye aur farmaya ke Ae Allah ! Ubaid Abu Aamir ko bakhsh de (Ubaid bin Sulaim un ka naam tha) yahan tak ke mein ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki donon baghalon ki safedi dekhi phir farmaya ke Ae Allah ! Abu Aamir ko qayamat ke din bohat se logon ka sardar karna mein ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! aur mere liye bhi bakhshish ki dua farmayie to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ae Allah ! Abdullah bin Qais ke gunah bhi bakhsh de aur qayamat ke din us ko izzat ke makaan mein le ja Burda raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke aik dua Abu Aamir ke liye ki aur aik dua Abu Musa ke liye ki raziyallahu anhuma "
"1708","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein apni walida ko Islam ki taraf bilata tha aur wo mushrik thi aik din mein ne us ko Musalman honay ko kaha to us ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke haq mein wo baat sunayi jo mujhe nagawar guzari mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas rota hua aaya aur arz kiya ke mein apni walida ko Islam ki taraf bilata tha wo na maanti thi aaj us ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke haq mein mujhe wo baat sunayi jo mujhe nagawar hai to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Allah Taala se dua kijiye ke wo Abu Huraira ki maan ko hidayat de Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ae Allah ! Abu Huraira ki maan ko hidayat kar de mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki dua se khush ho kar nikla jab ghar par aaya aur darwaza par pahuncha to wo band tha meri maan ne mere paon ki aawaz suni aur boli ke zara thehra reh mein ne pani ke girnay ki aawaz suni gharz meri maan ne ghusl kiya aur apna kurta pehan kar jaldi se orhni orhi phir darwaza khola aur boli ke Ae Abu Huraira ! ” mein gawahi deti hun ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood barhaq nahi hai aur mein gawahi deti hun ke Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Allah ke banday aur us ke Rasool hain “ Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas khushi se rota hua aaya aur arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! khush ho jayie Allah Taala ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki dua qabool ki aur Abu Huraira ki maan ko hidayat ki to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Allah Taala ki tareef aur us ki sifat ki aur behtar baat kahi mein ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Allah Azza wa Jal se dua kijiye ke meri aur meri maan ki mohabbat Musalmanon ke dilon mein daal de aur un ki mohabbat hamaray dilon mein daal de tab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ae Allah ! apne bandon ki yani Abu Huraira aur un ki maan ki mohabbat apne momin bandon ke dilon mein daal de aur mominon ki mohabbat un ke dilon mein daal de phir koi momin aisa paida nahi hua jis ne mujhe suna ho ya dekha ho magar us ne mujh se mohabbat rakhi "
"1709","[AI-translation] ´Urwa bin Zubair raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke` Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke tum Abu Huraira par taajjub nahi kartay wo aaye aur mere hujray ke aik taraf baith kar Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se hadees bayan karnay lagay mein sun rahi thi lekin mein nafl padh rahi thi aur wo mere farigh honay se pehle chal diye agar mein un ko paati to un ka radd karti kyunke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam us tarah se jaldi jaldi baatein nahi kartay thay jaisay tum kartay ho bin Shihab ne bin Musayyab se kaha ke beshak Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke log kehtay hain ke Abu Huraira ne bohat hadeesein bayan kein aur Allah Taala jaanchay wala hai aur ye bhi kehtay hain ke Muhajireen aur Ansaar Abu Huraira ki tarah hadeesein kyun nahi bayan kartay anqareeb mein tum se us ka sabab bayan karta hun mere Ansari bhai jo thay wo apni zameen ki khidmat mein mashghool rehtay aur jo Muhajireen thay wo bazaar ke ma'amalon mein aur mein apna pait bhar kar Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath rehta pas mein haazir rehta aur wo ghaib rehtay aur mein yaad rakhta aur wo bhool jatay aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aik din farmaya ke tum mein se kaun apna kapra bichhata hai aur meri hadees sun kar phir us ko apne seenay se lagao to jo baat sunay ga wo na bhoole ga mein ne apni chaadar bichha di yahan tak ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hadees se farigh hue phir mein ne us chaadar ko seenay se laga liya us din se mein kisi baat ko jo ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne bayan ki nahi bhoola aur agar ye do aayaat na hotein jo ke Quran Majeed mein naazil hain to mein kisi se koi hadees bayan na karta ke ” jo log chhupatay hain jo ham ne nishaniaan utaarein aur hidayat ki baatein to un par lanat hai ........ “ aakhir tak "
"1710","[AI-translation] ´Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Uhud ke din talwaar pakari aur farmaya ke ye mujh se kaun leta hai logon ne haath phailaye aur har aik kehta tha ke mein lun ga mein lun ga Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke us ka haq kaun ada karay ga ye suntay hi log peechay hate (kyunke Uhud ke din kafiron ka ghalba tha) Simaak bin Kharsha Abu Dujaana raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke mein us ka haq ada karun ga phir unhon ne us ko le liya aur mushrikon ke sar us talwaar se cheere "
"1711","[AI-translation] ´Abu Zumail kehtay hain ke` mujh se Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ne bayan kiya aur kaha ke Musalman Sufyan ki taraf dhyaan na kartay thay aur na us ke saath baithtay thay (kyunke Sufyan kai martaba Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se lara tha aur Musalmanon ka sakht dushman tha) aik baar wo Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se bola ke Ae Nabi Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ! teen baatein mujhe ataa farmayie Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke acha Sufyan ne kaha ke mere paas wo aurat hai ke tamam Arabon mein haseen aur khoobsurat hai Umm Habiba meri beti mein us ka nikah Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se kar deta hun Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya acha doosri ye ke mere betay Muawiya raziyallahu anhu ko apna munshi banayie Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke acha teesray mujh ko kafiron se larnay ka hukm dijiye (jaisay Islam se pehle) Musalmanon se larta tha to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke acha Abu Zumail ne kaha ke agar wo un baaton ka sawal Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se na kartay to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam na detay us liye ke (Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki aadat thi) ke jab Aap se koi sawal kiya jata to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam haan hi kartay thay "
"1712","[AI-translation] ´Abu Barza raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke` Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aik jihad mein thay Allah Taala ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko (fatah ke saath) maal ghaneemat diya Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apne logon se farmaya ke tum mein se koi ghaib to nahi hai logon ne arz kiya ke haan falan falan falan shakhs ghaib hain phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne poocha ke koi aur to ghaib nahi hai logon ne kaha ke falan falan shakhs ghaib hain phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke aur to koi ghaib nahi hai logon ne arz kiya ke koi nahi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mein Julaibeeb raziyallahu anhu ko nahi dekhta logon ne un ko mardon mein dhoonda to un ki laash saat laashon ke paas paayi gayi jin ko Julaibeeb ne maara tha wo saat ko maar kar shaheed ho gaye Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam un ke paas aaye aur wahan kharay ho kar phir farmaya ke us ne saat aadmiyon ko maara us ke baad khud maara gaya ye mujh se hai aur mein us se hun phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us ko apne donon haathon par rakha aur sirf Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke haath hi us ki chaarpaayi thay us ke baad qabr khudwa kar us mein rakh diya aur rawi ne ghusl ka bayan nahi kiya "
"1713","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Umar bin Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) Hassan raziyallahu anhu ke paas se guzray aur wo masjid mein shair padh rahay thay (maloom hua ke ashaar jo Islam ki tareef aur kafiron ki burayi ya jihad ki targheeb mein ho masjid mein padhna durust hai) Umar raziyallahu anhu ne un ki taraf (ghussa se) dekha Hassan raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke mein to masjid mein (us waqt bhi) shair padhta tha jab tum se behtar shakhs (yani Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) maujood thay phir Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ki taraf dekha aur kaha ke mein tumhein Allah ki qasam deta hun ke tum ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke Ae Hassan ! meri taraf se jawab de Ae Allah us ki rooh ul Qudus (Jibrail alaihissalam) se madad kar Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha haan mein ne suna hai ya Allah to janta hai "
"1714","[AI-translation] ´Bara bin Azib (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Hassan bin saabit raziyallahu anhu se farmatay thay ke (kafiron ki) hajw kar aur Jibrail tere saath hain (kisi ki burayi bayan karnay ko hajw kehtay hain) "
"1715","[AI-translation] ´Masrooq kehtay hain ke` mein Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ke paas gaya to un ke paas Hassan bin saabit raziyallahu anhu baithay apni ghazal mein se aik shair suna rahay thay jo chand baiton ki unhon ne kahi thi wo shair ye hai ke : ” paak hain aur aqal wali un pe kuch tohmat nahi subah ko uthti hain bhooki ghafilon ke gosht se “ (yani kisi ki gheebat nahi kartein kyunke gheebat karna goya us ka gosht khana hai) Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne Hassan raziyallahu anhu se kaha ke lekin to aisa nahi hai (yani to logon ki gheebat karta hai) Masrooq ne kaha ke mein ne Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se kaha ke Aap Hassan raziyallahu anhu ko apne paas kyun aanay deti ho halanke Allah Taala ne un ki shaan mein farmaya hai ke ” wo shakhs jis ne un mein se bari baat (yani Aisha (raziyallahu anha) par tohmat laganay) ka baira uthaya us ke wastay bara azaab hai (Hassan bin saabit raziyallahu anhu un logon mein shareek thay jinhon ne Aisha (raziyallahu anha) par tohmat lagayi thi phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne un ko had lagayi) Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke us se zyada azaab kiya ho ga ke wo nabina ho gaya hai aur kaha ke wo Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki taraf se kafiron ki jawaabdihi karta tha ya hajw karta tha (us liye us ko apne paas aanay ki ijazat deti hun) "
"1716","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Quraish ki hajw karo kyunke hajw un ko teeron ki bauchhaar se zyada nagawar hai phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aik shakhs ko bin Rawaha raziyallahu anhu ke paas bheja aur farmaya ke Quraish ki hajw karo unhon ne hajw ki lekin Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko pasand na aayi phir Ka'b bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) ke paas bheja phir Hassan bin saabit raziyallahu anhu ke paas bheja jab Hassan Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaye to unhon ne kaha ke tum par wo waqt aa gaya ke tum ne us sher ko bila bheja jo apni dam se maarta hai (yani apni zubaan se logon ko qatl karta hai goya maidaan fasaahat aur shair goyi ke sher hain) phir apni zubaan bahar nikaali aur us ko hilanay lagay aur arz kiya ke qasam us ki jis ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko sacha paighambar kar ke bheja hai mein kafiron ko apni zubaan se us tarah phaar daalun ga jaisay chamray ko phaar daaltay hain Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ae Hassan ! jaldi mat kar ! kyunke Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) Quraish ke nasab ko bakhoobi jantay hain aur mera bhi nasab Quraish hi hain to wo mera nasab tujhe alehda kar dein ge phir Hassan Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aaye phir us ke baad lautay aur arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka nasab mujh se bayan kar diya hai qasam us ki jis ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko sacha paighambar kar ke bheja mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko Quraish mein se aisa nikaal lun ga jaisay baal aatay mein se nikaal liya jata hai Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Hassan se farmatay thay ke rooh ul Qudus hamesha teri madad kartay rahein ge jab tak to Allah aur us ke Rasoolullah ki taraf se jawab deta rahay ga aur Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke Hassan ne Quraish ki hajw ki to mominon ke dilon ko shifa di aur kafiron ki izzaton ko tabah kar diya Hassan ne kaha ke to ne Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki burayi ki to mein ne us ka jawab diya aur Allah Taala us ka badla de ga to ne Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki burayi ki jo naik aur parhezgaar hain Allah Taala ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hain aur wafaadaari un ki khaslat hai mere baap dada aur meri aabru Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki aabru bachanay ke liye qurban hain agar Kadaa (Makka ke darwaza par ghaati) ke donon jaanib se ghubaar urta ho na dekho to mein apni jaan ko khoon aisi oontniyan jo baagon par zor karein gi aur apni quwwat aur taqat se upar charhti huein un ke kandhon par wo barchhay hain jo baareek hain ya khoon ki pyaasi hain aur hamaray ghoray daurtay hue aayein ge un ke munh aurtein apne dopatton se poonchhti hain agar tum ham se na bolo to ham Umra kar lein ge aur fatah ho jaye gi aur parda uth jaye ga nahi to us din ki maar ke liye sabr karo jis din Allah Taala jis ko chahay ga izzat de ga aur Allah Taala ne farmaya ke mein ne aik lashkar tayyar kiya hai jo Ansaar ka lashkar hai jis ka khail kafiron se muqabla karna hai aur Allah Taala ne farmaya ke mein ne aik banda bheja jo sach kehta hai us ki baat mein kuch shubha nahi hai ham to har roz aik na aik tayyari mein hain gaali gilaunch hai kafiron se ya larai hai ya kafiron ki hajw hai tum mein se jo koi Allah ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki hajw karay aur un ki tareef karay ya madad karay wo sab barabar hain Jibrail Allah ke Rasoolullah ham mein hain aur rooh ul Qudus jin ka koi misl nahi hai "
"1717","[AI-translation] ´Jarir raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` jab se mein Musalman hua hun Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mujhe kabhi andar aanay se nahi roka aur mujhe kabhi nahi dekha magar Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam apne chehray par muskuraahat liye hue hotay thay (yani khanda royi aur kushaada peshani se miltay thay) "
"1718","[AI-translation] ´Jarir raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` mujh se Rasoolullah ne farmaya ke Ae Jarir ! to mujhe Zul Khalasa se aaraam nahi deta aur Zul Khalasa (qabeela) Khasam ka aik but khana tha us ko Kaaba Yamaani bhi kehtay thay Jarir raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke mein dairh sau sawaar le kar wahan gaya aur mein ghoray par nahi jamta tha to mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se ye bayan kiya to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apna haath mere seenay par maara aur farmaya ke Ae Allah us ko jama de aur us ko raah dikhanay wala raah paya hua kar de phir Jarir raziyallahu anhu gaye aur Zul Khalasa ko aag se jala diya us ke baad aik shakhs jis ka naam Abu Artaat tha khushkhabri ke liye Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas rawana kiya wo Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaya aur kehnay laga ke ham Zul Khalasa ko khaarishi oont ki tarah chhor kar aaye (khaarishi oont par kala roghan miltay hain matlab ye hai ke wo bhi Jal kar kala ho gaya tha) Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne (qabeela) Ahmas ke ghoron aur mardon ke liye paanch martaba barkat ki dua ki "
"1719","[AI-translation] ´Umm Mubashshir raziyallahu anha se riwayat hai ke` unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Umm ul-Momineen Hafsa raziyallahu anha ke paas farmatay thay ke insha Allah ashaab Shajara mein se koi jahannam mein na jaye ga yani jin logon ne darakht ke neechay bai'at ki unhon ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! kyun na jayein ge Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne un ko jhirka Hafsa raziyallahu anha ne kaha ke Allah Taala farmata hai ke ” koi tum mein se aisa nahi jo jahannam par se na jaye “ (Surah : Maryam 71) pas Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke beshak Allah Taala farmata hai ke ” phir ham parhezgaaron ko nijaat dein ge aur zaalimon ko un ke ghutnon ke bal us mein chhor dein ge “ (Surah : Maryam 72) "
"1720","[AI-translation] ´Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke` hamein yani Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mujhe Zubair raziyallahu anhu aur Miqdad raziyallahu anhu ko Rauza Khaakh muqaam par bheja aur farmaya ke jao aur wahan tumhein aik aurat oont par sawaar milay gi us ke paas aik khat hai wo us se le kar aao ham ghoray dauraatay hue chalay achanak wo aurat hamein mili to ham ne us se kaha ke khat nikaal wo boli ke mere paas to koi khat nahi hai ham ne kaha ke khat nikaal ya apne kapray utaar pas us ne wo khat apne jore se nikala ham wo khat Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas le kar aaye us mein likha tha Haatib bin Abu Balta'a ki taraf se Makka ke baaz mushrikeen ke naam (aur us mein) Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki baaz baaton ka zikr tha (aik riwayat mein hai ke Haatib ne us mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki tayyari aur fauj ki aamaadgi aur Makka ki rawaangi se kafiron ko muttala kiya tha) Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ae Haatib ! to ne ye kiya kiya wo bolay ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Aap jaldi na farmayie (yani fauran bolay ke mujhe saza na dijiye mera haal sun lijiye) mein Quraish se mila hua aik shakhs tha yani un ka haleef tha aur Quraish mein se na tha aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke Muhajireen jo hain un ke rishta daar Quraish mein bohat hain jin ki wajah se un ke gharbaar ka bachao hota hai to mein ne ye chaha ke mera naata to Quraish se nahi hai mein bhi un ka koi kaam aisa kar dun jis se mere ahl o ayaal walon ka bachao karein ge aur mein ne ye kaam us wajah se nahi kiya ke mein kafir ho gaya hun ya murtad ho gaya hun aur na Musalman honay ke baad kufr se khush ho kar kiya hai Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Haatib ne sach kaha Umar raziyallahu anhu ne ke ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! Aap chhoryie mein us munafiq ki gardan maaron Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke ye to Badr ki larai mein shareek tha aur to nahi janta ke Allah Taala ne Badr walon ko jhaanka aur farmaya ke tum jo aamaal chaho karo (basharteke kufr tak na pahunchein) mein ne tumhein bakhsh diya tab Allah Taala ne ye aayat utari ke ” Ae iman walo ! mere aur apne dushmanon ko dost mat banao “ (Surah : al-Mumtahana : 1) "
"1721","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Quraish Ansaar Mazina Juhaina Aslam Ghaffar aur Ashja (saaray qabaail) dost hain aur siwa Allah Taala ke aur us ke Rasoolullah ke un ka koi himaayati nahi "
"1722","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna ke Aap farmatay thay ke Quraish ki aurtein behtareen aurtein hain jo oonton par sawaar huein bachay par sab se zyada meharban (jab wo chota ho) aur apne shohar ke maal ki bari nigehbaan hain (rawi kehtay hain ke) Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kaha kartay thay ke Maryam bint Imran raziyallahu anha kabhi oont par nahi charhein "
"1723","[AI-translation] ´Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` ye aayat ke ” jab tum mein se do girohon ne himmat haar denay ka qasd kiya aur Allah un donon ka dost hai “ (aal Imran : 122) ham logon yani Bani Salama aur Bani Harisa ke baaray mein naazil aur ham nahi chahtay ke ye aayat na utarti kyunke Allah Taala farmata hai ke ” aur Allah un donon ka dost hai “ "
"1724","[AI-translation] ´Zaid bin Arqam raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Ae Allah ! Ansaar ko bakhsh de aur Ansaar ke beton ko aur poton ko (bhi maaf farma de) "
"1725","[AI-translation] ´Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne bachon aur auraton ko shaadi se aatay hue dekha to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam saamnay kharay hue aur farmaya ke Ae logon ! tum sab logon se zyada mujhe mehbub ho Ae logon ! tum sab logon se zyada mujhe mehbub ho yani Ansaar ke logon se farmaya "
"1726","[AI-translation] ´Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Ansaar ki bakhshish ke liye aur Ansaar ki aulad aur un ke ghulamon ke liye bhi bakhshish ki dua ki "
"1727","[AI-translation] ´Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Ansaar meri antariyaan aur meri gathriyaan hain (kapra rakhnay ki yani mere khaas mo'tamad aur aitbaari log hain) aur log barhtay jayein ge aur Ansaar ghattay jayein ge pas un ki neki ko qabool karo aur un ki burayi se darguzar karo "
"1728","[AI-translation] ´Abu Usaid Ansari raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Ansaar mein behtar ghar Bani Najjar ka hai phir Bani Abd-e-Ashhal ka phir Bani Haris bin Khazraj ka phir Bani Sa'ida ka aur Ansaar ke har ghar mein behtari hai Salama ne kaha ke Abu Usaid ne kaha ke kiya mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par tohmat karta hun agar mein jhoota hota to pehle apni qaum Bani Sa'ida ka naam leta ye khabar Sa'd bin Ubada raziyallahu anhu ko pahunchi to unhein ranj hua aur wo kehnay lagay ke ham peechay chhor diye gaye ham chaaron ke aakhir mein hue mere gadhay par zeen kaso ke mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas jaun ga Sahl raziyallahu anhu ke bhatijay ne un se kaha ke tum Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas un ki baat ka radd karnay jatay ho halanke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam khoob jantay hain kiya tumhein ye kaafi nahi hai ke chaar mein se chauthay tum ho ye sun kar Sa'd lautay aur farmaya ke Allah aur us ka Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam khoob jantay hain aur gadhay se zeen ko khol daalnay ka hukm diya "
"1729","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein Jarir bin Abdullah bijli raziyallahu anhu ke saath safar mein nikla aur wo meri khidmat kartay thay mein ne kaha ke tum meri khidmat mat karo (kyunke tum baray ho) unhon ne kaha ke mein ne Ansaar ko Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath jo kaam kartay dekha hai to qasam khayi hai ke jab kisi Ansaar ke saath hun ga to us ki khidmat karun ga (yani Ansaar ne Aap ke saath jo sulook kiya hai aur dushman se hifazat ki hai waghera) aur Jarir raziyallahu anhu Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se baray thay "
"1730","[AI-translation] ´Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : ke mein Asharion ki aawaz Quran padhnay se pehchan leta hun jab wo raat ko aatay hain aur raat ko un ki aawaz se un ka thikana bhi pehchan leta hun agarchay din ko un ka thikana na dekha ho jab wo din ko utray hun aur unhi logon mein se aik shakhs Hakeem hai ke jab kafiron ke sawaaron se ya dushmanon se milta hai to un se kehta hai hamaray log tum se kehtay hain ke zara hamein fursat do ya thora intezar karo yani ham bhi tayyar hain larnay ko aatay hain (yani apne tayein daanayi aur hikmat se bacha leta hai kyunke dushman ye samajhtay hain ke ye akeela nahi hai balke us ke saath aur log bhi hain) "
"1731","[AI-translation] ´Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : beshak Ashari qabeela ke log jab larai mein mohtaaj ho jatay hain ya Madina mein un ke biwi bachon ka khana kam ho jata hai to jo kuch un ke paas hota hai us ko aik kapray mein ikaththa kartay hain phir aapas mein barabar baant letay hain ye log mere hain aur mein un ka hun (yani mein un se raazi hun aur aisay ittifaaq ko pasand karta hun) "
"1732","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Allah Taala ne (qabeela) Aslam ko salaamat rakha aur (qabeela) Ghaffar ko bakhsha aur ye mein nahi kehta balke Allah Azza wa Jal farmata hai "
"1733","[AI-translation] ´Khafaaf bin Eema Ghaffari raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apni namaz mein farmaya ke Ae Allah ! Bani Lihyaan ko lanat kar aur Ri'l ko Zakwaan aur Usayya ko jinhon ne Allah Taala ki aur us ke Rasoolullah ki nafarmani ki aur Allah Taala ne (qabeela) Ghaffar ko bakhsh diya aur (qabeela) Aslam ko mehfooz kar diya "
"1734","[AI-translation] ´Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Aqra bin Haabis raziyallahu anhu Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaye aur kaha ke haajion ko lautnay walay (qabaail) Aslam Ghaffar Mazina aur Juhaina ke logon ne bai'at ki Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke agar (qabeela) Aslam Ghaffar Mazina aur Juhaina qabaail Bani Tameem Bani Amir Asad aur Ghatfaan se behtar hun to ye log (yani Bani Tameem waghera) khusaray mein rahay aur naamuraad hue) wo bola haan Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke qasam hai us ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai wo un se behtar hai (yani qabeela Aslam aur Ghaffar waghera qabeela Bani Tameem waghera se behtar hain) "
"1735","[AI-translation] ´Adi bin Hatim (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein Umar bin Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aaya to unhon ne mujh se kaha ke sab se pehla sadqa jis ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke ashaab ke chehron ko chamka diya (yani un ko khush kar diya qabeela) Tai ka sadqa tha (aur kaha ke) wo sadqa tum (yani Adi bin Hatim) Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas le kar aaye thay "
"1736","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Tufail raziyallahu anhu aur un ke saathi aaye aur kehnay lagay ke Ae Allah ke Rasoolullah ! (qabeela) Daus ne kufr ikhtiyar kiya hai aur Musalman honay se inkar kiya to Daus ke liye baddua kijiye kaha gaya ke Daus ke log tabah hue Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ae Allah ! Daus ko hidayat kar aur un ko mere paas le kar aa "
"1737","[AI-translation] ´Abu Zar kehtay hain ke` Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke mein hamesha (qabeela) Bani Tameem se teen baaton ki wajah se mohabbat rakhta hun jo mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se sunein hain mein ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko farmatay hue suna ke wo meri ummat mein Dajjal par sab se zyada sakht hain aur un ke sadqay aaye to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke ye hamari qaum ke sadqay hain aur us qabeelay ki aik aurat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ke paas qaidi thi to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke us ko azaad kar de ye Isma'eel alaihissalam ki aulad mein se hai "
"1738","[AI-translation] ´Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Abu Ubaida Jarraah aur Talha raziyallahu anhuma mein bhai chaara kara diya "
"1739","[AI-translation] ´Aasim Ahwal kehtay hain ke` Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se kaha gaya ke kiya Aap ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna hai ke Islam mein half nahi hai to Anas (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke beshak Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Quraish aur Ansaar ke darmiyan apne ghar mein half karaya "
"1740","[AI-translation] ´Jubair bin Mut'im raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Islam mein half nahi hai (yani aisa half jis mein wiraasat waghera tak mein shirkat ho) aur jo qasam jahiliyat ke zamanay mein (naik baat ke liye) ki ho wo Islam se aur mazboot ho gayi "
"1741","[AI-translation] ´Burda apne walid raziyallahu anhu se riwayat kartay hain ` unhon ne kaha ham ne Maghrib ki namaz Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath padhi phir ham ne kaha ke agar ham baithay rahein yahan tak ke Isha Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath padhein to behtar ho ga phir ham baithay rahay aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam bahar tashreef laaye Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tum yeein baithay rahay ho ham ne arz kiya ke ji haan Ae Allah ke Rasool ! ham ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath namaz Maghrib padhi phir ham ne kaha ke agar ham baithay rahein yahan tak ke Isha ki namaz bhi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath padhein to behtar ho ga Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tum ne acha kiya ya theek kiya phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apna sar aasmaan ki taraf uthaya aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aksar apna sar aasmaan ki taraf uthaya kartay thay phir farmaya ke sitaray aasmaan ke bachao hain jab sitaray mit jayein ge to aasmaan par bhi jis baat ka waada hai wo aa jaye gi (yani qayamat aa jaye gi aur aasmaan bhi phat kar kharaab ho jaye ga) aur mein apne ashaab ka bachao hun jab mein chala jaun ga to mere ashaab par bhi wo waqt aa jaye ga jis ka waada hai (yani fitna aur fasaad aur laraiaan) aur mere ashaab meri ummat ke bachao hain jab ashaab chalay jayein ge to meri ummat par wo waqt aa jaye ga jis ka waada hai (yani ikhtilaf o intishaar waghera) "
"1742","[AI-translation] ´Abu Sa'eed Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : logon par aik zamana aaye ga ke aadmiyon ke jhand jihad karein ge to un se poochein ge ke koi tum mein se wo shakhs hai jis ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko dekha ho to wo log kahein ge ke haan ! to un ki fatah ho jaye gi phir logon ke giroh jihad karein ge to un se poochein ge ke tum mein se koi wo hai jis ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke sahabi ko dekha ho (yani taabein mein se koi hai) log kahein ke ke haan ! phir un ki fatah ho jaye gi phir aadmiyon ke lashkar jihad karein ge to un se poocha jaye ga ke tum mein se koi wo hai jis ne sahabi ke dekhnay walay ko dekha ho (yani taba' taabein mein se) to log kahein ge ke haan phir logon ke giroh jihad karein ge to poochein ge ke kiya tum mein koi aisa aadmi hai jis ne ittiba taabein ko dekha ho "
"1743","[AI-translation] ´Imran bin Husain (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : tum sab mein behtareen zamana mera hai phir jo un se qareeb hain phir jo un se qareeb hain phir jo un se qareeb hain Imran raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke mein theek se nahi janta ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam apne zamana ke baad do ka zikr farmaya ya teen ka zikr farmaya phir un ke baad wo log paida hun ge jo gawahi ke mutaaliba ke baghair gawahi dein ge khaayin hun ge aur amantdaari na karein ge nazr manein ge lekin poori na karein ge aur un mein motapa phail jaye ga "
"1744","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : (jaisay baaz kaan sonay ki hai aur baaz lohay ki waisay hi aadmi bhi mukhtalif hain kisi ka khaandaan umda hai asal hai koi acha hai koi bura hai) tum logon ko kaanon ki tarah pao ge pas jo jahiliyat mein behtar thay wo Islam mein bhi behtar hain jab deen mein samajhdaar ho jayein aur tum behtar us ko pao ge jo Musalman honay se pehle Islam se bohat nafrat rakhta ho (yani jo kufr mein mazboot tha wo Islam lanay ke baad Islam mein bhi aisa hi mazboot ho ga jaisay Umar aur Khalid bin Waleed raziyallahu anhuma waghera ya ye muraad hai ke jo khilafat se nafrat rakhay usi ki khilafat umda ho gi) aur tum sab se bura us ko pao ge jo do roya ho ke un ke paas aik munh le kar aaye aur un ke paas doosra munh le kar jaye "
"1745","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apni aakhri Umar mein aik raat hamein Isha ki namaz padhayi jab salam phera to kharay hue aur farmaya ke tum ne apni us raat ko dekha ab se sau baras ke aakhir par zameen walon mein se koi na rahay ga Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha ke log jo ” sau saal tak “ wali ahadees bayan kartay hain us mein unhein mughaalata laga hai balke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ye farmaya ke aaj jo log maujood hain un mein se koi na rahay ga yani ye sadi poori ho jaye gi "
"1746","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : mere ashaab ko bura mat kaho mere ashaab ko bura mat kaho qasam us ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai ke agar koi tum mein se Uhud pahar ke barabar sona (Allah ki raah mein) kharch karay to un ke mudd (sair bhar) ya aadhay mudd ke barabar bhi nahi ho sakta "
"1747","[AI-translation] ´Umar bin Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke taabein mein aik behtareen shakhs hai jis ko Uwais kehtay hain us ki aik maan hai (yani rishta daaron mein se sirf maan zinda ho gi) aur us ko aik safedi ho gi tum us se kehna ke tumharay liye dua karay "
"1748","[AI-translation] ´Aseer bin Jabir kehtay hain ke` Umar bin Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) ke paas jab Yaman se madad ke log aatay (yani wo log jo har mulk se Islam ke lashkar ki madad ke liye jihad karnay ko aatay hain) to wo un se poochtay ke tum mein Uwais bin Amir bhi koi shakhs hai yahan tak ke Umar raziyallahu anhu khud Uwais ke paas aaye aur poocha ke tumhara naam Uwais bin Amir hai unhon ne kaha ke haan Umar raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke tum muraad qabeela ki shaakh Qarn se ho unhon ne kaha ke haan unhon ne poocha ke tumhein baras tha wo acha ho gaya magar dirham barabar baaqi hai unhon ne kaha ke haan Umar raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke tumhari maan hai unhon ne kaha ke haan tab Umar raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke tumharay paas Uwais bin Amir Yaman walon ki kumki fauj ke saath aaye ga wo qabeela muraad se hai jo Qarn ki shaakh hai us ko baras tha wo acha ho gaya magar dirham baaqi hai us ki aik maan hai us ka ye haal hai ke agar Allah ke bharosay par qasam kha baithay to Allah Taala us ko sacha karay phir agar tujh se ho sakay to us se apne liye dua karana to mere liye dua karo pas Uwais ne Umar raziyallahu anhu ke liye bakhshish ki dua ki to Umar raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke tum kahan jana chahtay ho unhon ne kaha ke Kufa mein Umar raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke mein tumhein Kufa ke haakim ke naam aik khat likh dun unhon ne kaha ke mujhe khaaksaaron mein rehna acha maloom hota hai jab doosra saal aaya to aik shakhs ne Kufa ke raeeson mein se Hajj kiya wo Umar raziyallahu anhu se mila to Umar raziyallahu anhu ne us se Uwais ka haal poocha to wo bola ke mein ne Uwais ko us haal mein chhora ke un ke ghar mein asbaab kam tha aur (kharch se) tang thay Umar raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke Uwais bin Amir tumharay paas Yaman walon ke imdaadi lashkar ke saath aaye ga wo muraad qabeela ki shaakh Qarn mein se hai us ko baras tha wo acha ho gaya sirf dirham ke barabar baaqi hai us ki aik maan hai jis ke saath wo neki karta hai agar wo Allah par qasam kha baithay to Allah Taala us ko sacha karay phir agar tujh se ho sakay ke wo tere liye dua karay to us se dua karana wo shakhs ye sun kar Uwais ke paas aaya aur kehnay laga ke mere liye dua karo Uwais ne kaha ke to abhi naik safar kar ke aa raha hai (yani Hajj se) mere liye dua kar phir wo shakhs bola ke mere liye dua kar Uwais ne yehi jawab diya phir poocha ke to Umar raziyallahu anhu se mila wo shakhs bola ke haan mila Uwais ne us ke liye dua ki us waqt log Uwais ka darja samjhay wo wahan se seedhay chalay Aseer ne kaha ke mein ne un ko un ka libaas aik chaadar pehanayi jab koi aadmi un ko dekhta to kehta ke Uwais ke paas ye chaadar kahan se aayi hai "
"1749","[AI-translation] ´Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : tum aik mulk Misr ko fatah karo ge jahan qeeraat ka riwaaj ho ga (qeeraat dirham aur deenaar ka aik tukra hai aur Misr mein us ka bohat riwaaj tha) wahan ke logon se bhalayi karna kyunke un ka zimma tum par hai aur un ka tum se naata bhi hai (us liye ke Haajira Isma'eel alaihissalam ki walida Misr ki thin aur wo Arab ki maan hain) { ya ye farmaya ke un ka tum par haq hai aur un se daamaadi ka rishta bhi hai } (aur wo rishta ye tha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saahibzaday Ibrahim alaihi Islam ki walida maarya Misr ki thin) pas jab tum do ashkhaas ko wahan aik eent ki jagah par lartay hue dekho to wahan se nikal aana phir Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke mein ne dekha ke Abdur Rahman bin Shurhabeel bin hasana aur un ke bhai Rabia aik eent ki jagah par lar rahay thay to mein wahan se nikal aaya "
"1750","[AI-translation] ´Abu Barza raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aik aadmi ko Arab ke kisi qabeela ki taraf bheja (wahan ke) logon ne us ko bura kaha aur maara wo Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaya aur ye haal bayan kiya to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke agar to Umaan walon ke paas jata to wo tujhe bura na kehtay na maartay (kyunke wahan ke log achay hain) "
"1751","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` ham Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath baithay thay ke Surah Jumu'a naazil hui pas jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ye aayat padhi ke ” paak hai wo Allah jis ne Arab ki taraf paighambar bheja aur auron ki taraf bhi jo abhi Arab se nahi milay “ (Jumu'a : 3) aik shakhs ne poocha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! ye log kaun hain jo Arab ke siwa hain Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us ko jawab na diya yahan tak ke us ne aik do ya teen baar poocha us waqt ham logon mein Salman Farisi raziyallahu anhu bhi baithay hue thay pas Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apna dast mubarak un par rakha aur farmaya ke agar iman Surayya (sitaray) par hota to bhi un ki qaum mein se kuch log us tak pahunch jatay "
"1752","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : tum aadmiyon ko aisa patay ho jaisay sau oont ke un oonton mein aik bhi (chaalaak umda) sawaari ke qaabil nahi milta (usi tarah umda muhazzab aaqil naik naik bakht khush akhlaaq ya naik parhezgaar ya muwahhid deendaar sau aadmiyon mein aik aadmi bhi nahi nazar aata) "
"1753","[AI-translation] ´Abu Naufal kehtay hain ke` mein ne Abdullah bin Zubair raziyallahu anhu ko Madina ki ghaati par dekha (yani Makka ka wo naaka jo Madina ki raah mein hai) kehtay hain ke Quraish ke log un par se guzartay thay aur doosray log bhi (un ko Hajjaj ne sooli de kar usi par rehnay diya tha) yahan tak ke Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) bhi un par se guzray wahan kharay hue aur kaha ke salam alaikum ya Abu Khubaib ! (Abu Khubaib Abdullah bin Zubair raziyallahu anhu ki kunniyat hai aur Abu Bakr aur Abu Bukair bhi un ki kunniyat hai) Islam alaikum ya Abu Khubaib ! salam alaik ya Abu Khubaib ! (us se maloom hua ke mayyat ko teen baar salam karna mustahab hai) Allah ki qasam mein to tumhein us se mana karta tha Allah ki qasam mein to tumhein us se mana karta tha Allah ki qasam mein to tumhein us se mana karta tha (yani khilafat aur hukumat ikhtiyar karnay se) Allah ki qasam jahan tak mein janta hun tum rozah rakhnay walay aur raat ko ibadat karnay walay aur naatay ko jornay walay thay Allah ki qasam wo giroh jis ke tum buray ho wo umda giroh hai (ye unhon ne bar'aks kaha batreeq tanz ke yani bura giroh hai aur aik riwayat mein saaf hai ke wo bura giroh hai) phir Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) wahan se chalay gaye phir Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ke wahan theharnay aur baat karnay ki khabar Hajjaj tak pahunchi to us ne un ko sooli par se utrawa liya aur Yahud ke qaristaan mein dalwa diya (aur Hajjaj ye na samjha ke us se kiya hota hai insaan kahein bhi gire lekin us ke aamaal achay hona zaroori hain) phir Hajjaj ne un ki walida Asma bint Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhuma) ko bila bheja to unhon ne Hajjaj ke paas aanay se inkar kar diya Hajjaj ne phir bila bheja aur kaha ke tum aati ho to aao warna mein aisay shakhs ko bhejon ga jo tumhara chonda pakar kar ghaseet kar laaye ga unhon ne phir bhi aanay se inkar kiya aur kaha ke Allah ki qasam mein tere paas na aaun gi jab tak to mere paas us ko na bhejay jo mere baal kheenchta hua mujhe tere paas le jaye aakhir Hajjaj ne kaha ke meri jootiyan lao aur jootay pehan kar akarta hua chala yahan tak ke Asma (raziyallahu anha) ke paas pahuncha aur kaha ke tum ne dekha ke Allah ki qasam mein ne Allah Taala ke dushman ke saath kiya kiya (ye Hajjaj ne apne i'tiqaad ke muwafiq Abdullah bin Zubair raziyallahu anhu ko kaha warna wo khud Allah ka dushman tha) Asma (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke mein ne dekha ke to ne Abdullah bin Zubair ki duniya bigaar di aur us ne teri aakhirat bigaar di mein ne suna hai ke to Abdullah bin Zubair ko kehta tha ke do kamarband wali ka beta hai beshak Allah ki qasam mein do kamarband wali hun aik kamarband mein to mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aur Abu Bakr Siddiq raziyallahu anhu ka khana uthati thi ke janwar us ko kha na lein aur aik kamarband wo tha jo aurat ko darkaar hai (Asma (raziyallahu anha) ne apne kamarband ko phaar kar us ke do tukray kar liye thay aik se to kamarband baandhti thin aur doosray ka Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aur Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ke liye dastarkhwan banaya tha to ye Asma (raziyallahu anha) ki fazeelat thi jis ko Hajjaj aib samajhta tha aur Abdullah bin Zubair raziyallahu anhu ko zaleel karnay ke liye do kamarband wali ka beta kehta tha) to khabardaar reh ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ham se bayan kiya tha ke Saqeef mein aik jhoota paida ho ga aur aik halaaku to jhootay ko to ham ne dekh liya aur halaaku mein tere siwa kisi ko nahi samajhti ye sun kar Hajjaj khara hua aur Asma (raziyallahu anha) ko kuch jawab na diya "
